r."}]},"answer_key":{"value":"o1"},"reference_answer":"o1","incorrect_answer":"o2","explanation":"Nobody требует положительной формы knows и уже выражает отрицание."},{"id":"45585d54-df8d-50f3-831d-8d450384f749","lesson_id":"fdb0a79e-bb34-5422-addc-463e5a3a11d6","kind":"gap","prompt":"Дополни предложение подходящим словом или краткой формой.","position":2,"public_payload":{"sentence":"Is there ___ at reception?"},"answer_key":{"accepted":["anyone","anybody","someone","somebody"]},"reference_answer":"anyone","incorrect_answer":"nobody doesn't","explanation":"В нейтральном вопросе Is there anyone …? спрашивают, есть ли кто-нибудь."},{"id":"0298d166-40c2-5875-bcd9-0a539022d79b","lesson_id":"fdb0a79e-bb34-5422-addc-463e5a3a11d6","kind":"sentence","prompt":"Собери: «Кто-то оставил здесь сумку».","position":3,"public_payload":{"tokens":[{"id":"t3","label":"a"},{"id":"t4","label":"bag"},{"id":"t5","label":"here."},{"id":"t1","label":"Someone"},{"id":"t2","label":"left"}]},"answer_key":{"value":["t1","t2","t3","t4","t5"]},"reference_answer":["t1","t2","t3","t4","t5"],"incorrect_answer":["t2","t3","t4","t5","t1"],"explanation":"Someone — подлежащее; left — прошедшая форма leave."},{"id":"23d97a93-37be-5106-ac99-ac9765b2b9b2","lesson_id":"fdb0a79e-bb34-5422-addc-463e5a3a11d6","kind":"correction","prompt":"Убери двойное отрицание, сохрани смысл «Никто не пришёл»","position":4,"public_payload":{"sentence":"Nobody didn't come."},"answer_key":{"accepted":["Nobody came."]},"reference_answer":"Nobody came.","incorrect_answer":"Nobody didn't come.","explanation":"Nobody уже означает никто; дополнительное didn't меняет или усложняет смысл."},{"id":"3e5ce183-9546-5b22-9ec5-b6593e781d53","lesson_id":"fdb0a79e-bb34-5422-addc-463e5a3a11d6","kind":"translation","prompt":"Переведи на английский.","position":5,"public_payload":{"source":"Я никого не знаю в этом городе."},"answer_key":{"accepted":["I don't know anyone in this town.","I do not know anybody in this town."]},"reference_answer":