re delivered to customers' homes."},{"id":"o3","label":"They are inspected and washed."}],"passage":"At a small food company, vegetables are delivered early each morning. They are inspected and washed before they are cut. The prepared vegetables are packed in sealed containers, which are labelled with the date. Some orders are collected by local cafés, while others are delivered to homes. Products that fail the inspection are not used in customer orders."},"answer_key":{"value":"o3"},"reference_answer":"o3","incorrect_answer":"o1","explanation":"Перед cut в тексте стоят inspected and washed."},{"id":"b2744570-5924-502b-a948-9f8110833b02","lesson_id":"95830bb6-49ce-5426-90cf-af879054b2fb","kind":"dialogue","prompt":"Объясни, что заказы упаковывают сотрудники.","position":7,"public_payload":{"options":[{"id":"o1","label":"No, the orders are packed by our staff."},{"id":"o2","label":"No, customers are packing yesterday."},{"id":"o3","label":"Yes, our staff packs every order for them."}],"lines":[{"speaker":"Visitor","text":"Do customers pack the orders themselves?"}]},"answer_key":{"value":"o1"},"reference_answer":"o1","incorrect_answer":"o2","explanation":"Отрицательный ответ и passive by our staff согласуются с вопросом."},{"id":"7bd12224-e888-5954-9f11-164be26ef1da","lesson_id":"95830bb6-49ce-5426-90cf-af879054b2fb","kind":"context_choice","prompt":"Выбери форму для нескольких писем.","position":8,"public_payload":{"options":[{"id":"o1","label":"is"},{"id":"o2","label":"are"},{"id":"o3","label":"be"}],"sentence":"All application letters ___ read before interviews are arranged."},"answer_key":{"value":"o2"},"reference_answer":"o2","incorrect_answer":"o1","explanation":"Letters во множественном числе требует are."},{"id":"5859451f-68f4-5630-bd0c-5bbadca7e6fa","lesson_id":"28b596b1-fb0c-5b08-aa2c-309e0fc77921","kind":"single_choice","prompt":"Выбери корректный вежливый вопрос.","position":1,"public_payload":{"options":[{"id":"o1","label":"Could you tell me where is the