"1bb46fca-704b-5db1-a386-42f249e35c7a","kind":"correction","prompt":"Исправь форму","position":4,"public_payload":{"sentence":"He suggested to take a short break."},"answer_key":{"accepted":["He suggested taking a short break."]},"reference_answer":"He suggested taking a short break.","incorrect_answer":"He suggested to take a short break.","explanation":"После suggested здесь нужна форма taking."},{"id":"defcc0a4-0fe2-5108-a42e-f1aabeb347a8","lesson_id":"1bb46fca-704b-5db1-a386-42f249e35c7a","kind":"translation","prompt":"Переведи на английский.","position":5,"public_payload":{"source":"Я надеюсь найти новую работу."},"answer_key":{"accepted":["I hope to find a new job.","I am hoping to find a new job."]},"reference_answer":"I hope to find a new job.","incorrect_answer":"I enjoy finding a new job.","explanation":"Hope to find передаёт надежду; enjoy обозначает удовольствие."},{"id":"a6886117-879c-59e9-ba0a-721679b6f4ba","lesson_id":"1bb46fca-704b-5db1-a386-42f249e35c7a","kind":"reading","prompt":"Почему Джон выбрал работу в поддержке?","position":6,"public_payload":{"options":[{"id":"o1","label":"He wanted to avoid communicating with colleagues."},{"id":"o2","label":"He enjoyed helping people with technical problems."},{"id":"o3","label":"He had already been offered a job by his friend."}],"passage":"Jon wanted to change jobs, but he was unsure where to begin. A friend suggested making a list of the tasks he enjoyed doing. Jon realised that he liked helping colleagues solve technical problems and avoided working alone for long periods. He decided to apply for a support role and hoped to find a team that valued patient communication."},"answer_key":{"value":"o2"},"reference_answer":"o2","incorrect_answer":"o1","explanation":"Его интерес к помощи людям соответствует выбранной роли."},{"id":"3658dceb-a04a-5f76-afc8-c79045a2ab30","lesson_id":"1bb46fca-704b-5db1-a386-42f249e35c7a","kind":"dialogue","prompt":"Предложи заранее отправлять повестку.","position":7,"public_payload":{"options":[{"id":"o1","label":"I suggest to sending the agenda in advance."},{"id":"o2","label":"I suggest send the agenda in advance."},{"id":"o3","label":"I suggest sending the agenda in advance."}],"lines":[{"speaker":"Colleague","text":"How can we make our meetings shorter?"}]},"answer_key":{"value":"o3"},"reference_answer":"o3","incorrect_answer":"o1","explanation":"Suggest + sending — правильная модель."},{"id":"a333058e-a693-5f85-8077-3c2586ff383c","lesson_id":"1bb46fca-704b-5db1-a386-42f249e35c7a","kind":"context_choice","prompt":"Выбери форму после looking forward to.","position":8,"public_payload":{"options":[{"id":"o1","label":"meeting"},{"id":"o2","label":"meet"},{"id":"o3","label":"met"}],"sentence":"I'm looking forward to ___ the new team."},"answer_key":{"value":"o1"},"reference_answer":"o1","incorrect_answer":"o2","explanation":"To здесь предлог в устойчивом выражении, поэтому после него -ing."},{"id":"1c23168b-4c75-5504-b0fa-0eb8f2c5237f","lesson_id":"5b12e05e-6910-5f71-a4c9-952900195d3e","kind":"single_choice","prompt":"Выбери точный вариант: When Leo reached platform six, the train ___ already left.","position":1,"public_payload":{"options":[{"id":"v94ff22f9f0ab","label":"had"},{"id":"va1fa88f02c2b","label":"has"},{"id":"v8226176e34ed","label":"would"}]},"answer_key":{"value":"v94ff22f9f0ab"},"reference_answer":"v94ff22f9f0ab","incorrect_answer":"va1fa88f02c2b","explanation":"Поезд ушёл раньше, чем Лео добрался до платформы: had left."},{"id":"92ade6ca-6c7b-5014-9ec9-d94933c87258","lesson_id":"5b12e05e-6910-5f71-a4c9-952900195d3e","kind":"gap","prompt":"Вставь подходящее слово из пары: closed / close.","position":2,"public_payload":{"sentence":"The ticket office had ___ before we arrived."},"answer_key":{"accepted":["closed"]},"reference_answer":"closed","incorrect_answer":"close","explanation":"После had требуется причастие closed, а не начальная форма."},{"id":"851e0bad-9a65-58c1-abfe-b038ec3f6b9f","lesson_id":"5b12e05e-6910-5f71-a4c9-952900195d3e","kind":"sentence","prompt":"Собери предложение: «Пассажиры ушли до объявления.»","position":3,"public_payload":{"tokens":[{"id":"t3","label":"had"},{"id":"t4","label":"left"},{"id":"t5","label":"before"},{"id":"t6","label":"the"},{"id":"t7","label":"announcement."},{"id":"t1","label":"The"},{"id":"t2","label":"passengers"}]},"answer_key":{"value":["t1","t2","t3","t4","t5","t6","t7"]},"reference_answer":["t1","t2","t3","t4","t5","t6","t7"],"incorrect_answer":["t2","t3","t4","t5","t6","t7","t1"],"explanation":"Had left обозначает более раннее действие, before связывает события."},{"id":"cab1bee7-bbbd-5d79-b630-ce6ccf3b026f","lesson_id":"5b12e05e-6910-5f71-a4c9-952900195d3e","kind":"correction","prompt":"Исправь только ошибку в конструкции, сохраняя остальные слова и смысл.","position":4,"public_payload":{"sentence":"When we arrived, the bus has already departed."},"answer_key":{"accepted":["When we arrived, the bus had already departed."]},"reference_answer":"When we arrived, the bus had already departed.","incorrect_answer":"When we arrived, the bus has already departed.","explanation":"В рассказе о прошлом более раннее отправление выражается had departed."},{"id":"1254c13c-67c2-588d-bd9b-184666ffbc76","lesson_id":"5b12e05e-6910-5f71-a4c9-952900195d3e","kind":"reading","prompt":"Почему Лео не сел на поезд?","position":5,"public_payload":{"passage":"Leo reached the station at ten past eight. His ticket said that the train would leave at eight, but he hoped it was late. On platform six he found only a cleaner. The train had left on time. Leo went to the ticket office and changed his ticket for the next service. He decided to leave home earlier next time.","options":[{"id":"v19ba2074f39f","label":"The cleaner refused to let him board."},{"id":"v05c90dd87a0a","label":"His ticket was for a different station."},{"id":"v498c3a69b0ea","label":"It had left before he arrived."}]},"answer_key":{"value":"v498c3a69b0ea"},"reference_answer":"v498c3a69b0ea","incorrect_answer":"v19ba2074f39f","explanation":"Поезд ушёл в восемь, Лео прибыл на десять минут позже."},{"id":"78f5a92e-10d1-5155-a7c9-c67a2e652fa8","lesson_id":"5b12e05e-6910-5f71-a4c9-952900195d3e","kind":"reading","prompt":"Что Лео сделал после этого?","position":6,"public_payload":{"passage":"Leo reached the station at ten past eight. His ticket said that the train would leave at eight, but he hoped it was late. On platform six he found only a cleaner. The train had left on time. Leo went to the ticket office and changed his ticket for the next service. He decided to leave home earlier next time.","options":[{"id":"v1a766823c280","label":"He decided never to travel by train again."},{"id":"v54692827f983","label":"He changed his ticket for the next service."},{"id":"vebf2282238f1","label":"He caught the same train on another platform."}]},"answer_key":{"value":"v54692827f983"},"reference_answer":"v54692827f983","incorrect_answer":"vebf2282238f1","explanation":"Текст прямо сообщает об обмене билета; об отказе от поездок не говорится."},{"id":"e8a1a153-91b7-5d55-a6cc-c100d8610587","lesson_id":"5b12e05e-6910-5f71-a4c9-952900195d3e","kind":"dialogue","prompt":"Объясни пустые места более ранним событием в прошлом.","position":7,"public_payload":{"lines":[{"speaker":"Собеседник","text":"Why were the seats empty when you entered?"}],"options":[{"id":"v68c2022bd5a7","label":"The audience will go home tomorrow."},{"id":"v619244dfb8c7","label":"The audience goes home every Friday."},{"id":"v95aa2af29151","label":"The audience had already gone home."}]},"answer_key":{"value":"v95aa2af29151"},"reference_answer":"v95aa2af29151","incorrect_answer":"v68c2022bd5a7","explanation":"Had already gone объясняет состояние зала к моменту входа."},{"id":"d66beb78-ec87-5281-aa19-607f64c7bf59","lesson_id":"5b12e05e-6910-5f71-a4c9-952900195d3e","kind":"context_choice","prompt":"Выбери слово, точно соответствующее контексту.","position":8,"public_payload":{"sentence":"The train was due to leave at eight. Its scheduled ___ was eight o’clock.","options":[{"id":"v5dfc05cf501d","label":"passenger"},{"id":"v129b3bd98031","label":"departure"},{"id":"va91792a1311b","label":"platform"}]},"answer_key":{"value":"v129b3bd98031"},"reference_answer":"v129b3bd98031","incorrect_answer":"va91792a1311b","explanation":"Departure обозначает отправление; platform — место, passenger — человек."},{"id":"4d5e2f99-ddcc-5b10-8fb5-1b9927f569a2","lesson_id":"f9036ed8-5811-5a28-83e1-c2dfcb07b8d8","kind":"single_choice","prompt":"Выбери точный вариант: Maya started practising in September and still practises. She ___ for three months.","position":1,"public_payload":{"options":[{"id":"v7186371c89e1","label":"is practising yesterday"},{"id":"vee03f4684aad","label":"had practised tomorrow"},{"id":"v2542e88c733f","label":"has been practising"}]},"answer_key":{"value":"v2542e88c733f"},"reference_answer":"v2542e88c733f","incorrect_answer":"v7186371c89e1","explanation":"Has been practising показывает процесс, продолжающийся до настоящего."},{"id":"739f32f4-acf9-5087-9af0-ab5a150199fb","lesson_id":"f9036ed8-5811-5a28-83e1-c2dfcb07b8d8","kind":"gap","prompt":"Вставь подходящее слово из пары: since / for.","position":2,"public_payload":{"sentence":"We began on Monday and are still rehearsing. We have been rehearsing ___ Monday."},"answer_key":{"accepted":["since"]},"reference_answer":"since","incorrect_answer":"for","explanation":"В первой фразе Monday прямо задан как начало продолжающейся репетиции: since Monday. Здесь не имеется в виду подготовка к понедельнику (for Monday)."},{"id":"a67676d0-449a-5b99-9f6a-13bf50e667c4","lesson_id":"f9036ed8-5811-5a28-83e1-c2dfcb07b8d8","kind":"sentence","prompt":"Собери предложение: «Они работают над выступлением всё утро.»","position":3,"public_payload":{"tokens":[{"id":"t3","label":"been"},{"id":"t4","label":"working"},{"id":"t5","label":"on"},{"id":"t6","label":"the"},{"id":"t7","label":"performance"},{"id":"t8","label":"all"},{"id":"t9","label":"morning."},{"id":"t1","label":"They"},{"id":"t2","label":"have"}]},"answer_key":{"value":["t1","t2","t3","t4","t5","t6","t7","t8","t9"]},"reference_answer":["t1","t2","t3","t4","t5","t6","t7","t8","t9"],"incorrect_answer":["t2","t3","t4","t5","t6","t7","t8","t9","t1"],"explanation":"Have been working подчёркивает длительность процесса до настоящего."},{"id":"0512f665-0135-58e8-a7d3-71a3584412f1","lesson_id":"f9036ed8-5811-5a28-83e1-c2dfcb07b8d8","kind":"correction","prompt":"Исправь только ошибку в конструкции, сохраняя остальные слова и смысл.","position":4,"public_payload":{"sentence":"He has been learn the lines for two weeks."},"answer_key":{"accepted":["He has been learning the lines for two weeks."]},"reference_answer":"He has been learning the lines for two weeks.","incorrect_answer":"He has been learn the lines for two weeks.","explanation":"После has been в этой форме нужен learning."},{"id":"f4059f2d-8745-568e-8984-451ae72338c5","lesson_id":"f9036ed8-5811-5a28-83e1-c2dfcb07b8d8","kind":"reading","prompt":"Что происходит уже три месяца?","position":5,"public_payload":{"passage":"Maya joined a small theatre group in September. For three months she has been practising after work. At first she forgot her lines, but now she can perform most scenes without help. The group has not performed for an audience yet. Their first show is next Saturday. Maya is nervous, although she feels that regular practice has helped her.","options":[{"id":"vcd694d8007c6","label":"Maya has been teaching professional actors."},{"id":"v9ceccbcd5c1d","label":"Maya has been practising after work."},{"id":"va032b8edca50","label":"The group has been performing for paying audiences."}]},"answer_key":{"value":"v9ceccbcd5c1d"},"reference_answer":"v9ceccbcd5c1d","incorrect_answer":"va032b8edca50","explanation":"Практика продолжается; первое публичное выступление ещё впереди."},{"id":"5cc0f64c-a3f6-5195-a1fd-742b17116a06","lesson_id":"f9036ed8-5811-5a28-83e1-c2dfcb07b8d8","kind":"reading","prompt":"Что можно утверждать о результате практики?","position":6,"public_payload":{"passage":"Maya joined a small theatre group in September. For three months she has been practising after work. At first she forgot her lines, but now she can perform most scenes without help. The group has not performed for an audience yet. Their first show is next Saturday. Maya is nervous, although she feels that regular practice has helped her.","options":[{"id":"vd16f12949b69","label":"Maya can now perform most scenes without help."},{"id":"ve83b94711d28","label":"Maya never feels nervous."},{"id":"va7d779b7af87","label":"Every member has learnt every line perfectly."}]},"answer_key":{"value":"vd16f12949b69"},"reference_answer":"vd16f12949b69","incorrect_answer":"ve83b94711d28","explanation":"В тексте говорится об улучшении Майи, но не об идеальном знании всех участников."},{"id":"76841d9f-e723-574e-9e7f-2bb4e893597c","lesson_id":"f9036ed8-5811-5a28-83e1-c2dfcb07b8d8","kind":"dialogue","prompt":"Ответь о начавшейся во вторник и продолжающейся работе.","position":7,"public_payload":{"lines":[{"speaker":"Собеседник","text":"How long have you been preparing the scenery?"}],"options":[{"id":"v72cbdf5c7a1e","label":"We are paint it for Tuesday."},{"id":"v0dcc9d6ebcd9","label":"We have been painting it since Tuesday."},{"id":"v2e6a81146846","label":"We painted it next Tuesday."}]},"answer_key":{"value":"v0dcc9d6ebcd9"},"reference_answer":"v0dcc9d6ebcd9","incorrect_answer":"v2e6a81146846","explanation":"Have been painting и since Tuesday согласуют процесс и начальную точку."},{"id":"c563ee8f-e115-57e1-8496-8725d9f4a16d","lesson_id":"f9036ed8-5811-5a28-83e1-c2dfcb07b8d8","kind":"context_choice","prompt":"Выбери слово, точно соответствующее контексту.","position":8,"public_payload":{"sentence":"The actors meet every evening, so they rehearse ___.","options":[{"id":"v2f11152486c9","label":"regularly"},{"id":"v890787cb83eb","label":"accidentally"},{"id":"vd0439a7853a5","label":"rarely"}]},"answer_key":{"value":"v2f11152486c9"},"reference_answer":"v2f11152486c9","incorrect_answer":"v890787cb83eb","explanation":"Every evening указывает на регулярность, а не редкость или случайность."},{"id":"ea46e42f-263a-5b20-ac14-8627aaf55c3d","lesson_id":"99dadca9-2231-5598-af5c-6aa87bdd0807","kind":"single_choice","prompt":"Выбери точный вариант: We booked the room and agreed on a time. We ___ the tutor at three tomorrow.","position":1,"public_payload":{"options":[{"id":"vadac5061ace2","label":"have met yesterday"},{"id":"vd51366456c0d","label":"are meeting"},{"id":"v22fe35899d83","label":"met"}]},"answer_key":{"value":"vd51366456c0d"},"reference_answer":"vd51366456c0d","incorrect_answer":"v22fe35899d83","explanation":"Согласованная будущая встреча выражается are meeting с tomorrow."},{"id":"2f80dff9-bbb6-567b-b1a4-f80cdecad6c5","lesson_id":"99dadca9-2231-5598-af5c-6aa87bdd0807","kind":"gap","prompt":"Вставь подходящее слово из пары: seeing / saw.","position":2,"public_payload":{"sentence":"Nina is ___ the dentist at nine tomorrow."},"answer_key":{"accepted":["seeing"]},"reference_answer":"seeing","incorrect_answer":"saw","explanation":"В Present Continuous после is нужна форма seeing."},{"id":"feabfb0c-c9c8-5824-8c67-cebdffc299f9","lesson_id":"99dadca9-2231-5598-af5c-6aa87bdd0807","kind":"sentence","prompt":"Собери предложение: «Мы посещаем кампус в пятницу утром по договорённости.»","position":3,"public_payload":{"tokens":[{"id":"t3","label":"visiting"},{"id":"t4","label":"the"},{"id":"t5","label":"campus"},{"id":"t6","label":"on"},{"id":"t7","label":"Friday"},{"id":"t8","label":"morning."},{"id":"t1","label":"We"},{"id":"t2","label":"are"}]},"answer_key":{"value":["t1","t2","t3","t4","t5","t6","t7","t8"]},"reference_answer":["t1","t2","t3","t4","t5","t6","t7","t8"],"incorrect_answer":["t2","t3","t4","t5","t6","t7","t8","t1"],"explanation":"Будущее время задаёт on Friday morning, are visiting описывает запланированный визит."},{"id":"7a168310-0748-55fc-9312-100c61b83dd7","lesson_id":"99dadca9-2231-5598-af5c-6aa87bdd0807","kind":"correction","prompt":"Исправь только ошибку в конструкции, сохраняя остальные слова и смысл.","position":4,"public_payload":{"sentence":"I am meet the adviser tomorrow afternoon."},"answer_key":{"accepted":["I am meeting the adviser tomorrow afternoon."]},"reference_answer":"I am meeting the adviser tomorrow afternoon.","incorrect_answer":"I am meet the adviser tomorrow afternoon.","explanation":"Continuous строится с формой meeting после am."},{"id":"250c8198-2f0d-50e6-9f0c-b85634c4d8c2","lesson_id":"99dadca9-2231-5598-af5c-6aa87bdd0807","kind":"reading","prompt":"На какое время в итоге назначена встреча?","position":5,"public_payload":{"passage":"Nina emailed her tutor to arrange a meeting. They agreed on Thursday at three in the library. On Wednesday the tutor asked to move it to four because of another appointment. Nina checked her work schedule and agreed. She is meeting the tutor at four tomorrow. She has written down two questions, so she will not forget what she wants to discuss.","options":[{"id":"vb2ce031c42b9","label":"Thursday at four."},{"id":"v622e1c6298ba","label":"Wednesday at three."},{"id":"v03e379e6ccab","label":"Thursday at three."}]},"answer_key":{"value":"vb2ce031c42b9"},"reference_answer":"vb2ce031c42b9","incorrect_answer":"v622e1c6298ba","explanation":"Изначальные три часа заменили четырьмя; письмо о переносе пришло в среду."},{"id":"f584086e-1872-54ff-ab8c-6929f68196fa","lesson_id":"99dadca9-2231-5598-af5c-6aa87bdd0807","kind":"reading","prompt":"Зачем Нина записала вопросы?","position":6,"public_payload":{"passage":"Nina emailed her tutor to arrange a meeting. They agreed on Thursday at three in the library. On Wednesday the tutor asked to move it to four because of another appointment. Nina checked her work schedule and agreed. She is meeting the tutor at four tomorrow. She has written down two questions, so she will not forget what she wants to discuss.","options":[{"id":"v2bca857116c8","label":"To cancel the meeting."},{"id":"v886d9c7c0563","label":"To change the tutor’s work schedule."},{"id":"v80311b405552","label":"To remember what she wants to discuss."}]},"answer_key":{"value":"v80311b405552"},"reference_answer":"v80311b405552","incorrect_answer":"v2bca857116c8","explanation":"Цель записи прямо указана в последнем предложении."},{"id":"d3bfe2f8-36a3-520b-a8b6-e281d892d25d","lesson_id":"99dadca9-2231-5598-af5c-6aa87bdd0807","kind":"dialogue","prompt":"Сообщи о назначенном на это время занятии.","position":7,"public_payload":{"lines":[{"speaker":"Собеседник","text":"Are you free at ten tomorrow?"}],"options":[{"id":"v943e83988527","label":"Sorry, I am having a driving lesson then."},{"id":"vce7e36b2762e","label":"Sorry, I had a driving lesson tomorrow."},{"id":"ve07ca831e172","label":"Sorry, I have been tomorrow."}]},"answer_key":{"value":"v943e83988527"},"reference_answer":"v943e83988527","incorrect_answer":"vce7e36b2762e","explanation":"Am having с then относится к конкретной будущей договорённости."},{"id":"1ec114ef-d56b-53d6-9750-b2c4c25636ec","lesson_id":"99dadca9-2231-5598-af5c-6aa87bdd0807","kind":"context_choice","prompt":"Выбери слово, точно соответствующее контексту.","position":8,"public_payload":{"sentence":"We need a different time. Could we ___ the appointment?","options":[{"id":"v2727691d67f5","label":"confirm yesterday"},{"id":"vfb9b1ddca257","label":"borrow"},{"id":"v42b510eb479e","label":"reschedule"}]},"answer_key":{"value":"v42b510eb479e"},"reference_answer":"v42b510eb479e","incorrect_answer":"v2727691d67f5","explanation":"Reschedule означает перенести назначенную встречу на другое время."},{"id":"7a64541f-3697-5137-95c8-b2785c9d7ab1","lesson_id":"24bb7028-2dc2-5579-9086-1e410fcf2015","kind":"single_choice","prompt":"Выбери точный вариант: Could you tell me where ___?","position":1,"public_payload":{"options":[{"id":"v20b5114b5273","label":"the reception desk is"},{"id":"vdfacbc368c76","label":"is the reception desk"},{"id":"v5c4e2a7b9993","label":"does the reception desk"}]},"answer_key":{"value":"v20b5114b5273"},"reference_answer":"v20b5114b5273","incorrect_answer":"vdfacbc368c76","explanation":"После where в косвенном вопросе подлежащее идёт перед is."},{"id":"8e12bbd9-7430-526e-b8e0-0f586baf99ff","lesson_id":"24bb7028-2dc2-5579-9086-1e410fcf2015","kind":"gap","prompt":"Вставь подходящее слово из пары: whether / what.","position":2,"public_payload":{"sentence":"Do you know ___ the office opens on Sundays?"},"answer_key":{"accepted":["whether"]},"reference_answer":"whether","incorrect_answer":"what","explanation":"Whether вводит косвенный yes/no-вопрос о работе по воскресеньям."},{"id":"4e76121d-c92a-516a-9913-1453491210a9","lesson_id":"24bb7028-2dc2-5579-9086-1e410fcf2015","kind":"sentence","prompt":"Собери предложение: «Не могли бы вы сказать, когда начинается следующая экскурсия?»","position":3,"public_payload":{"tokens":[{"id":"t3","label":"tell"},{"id":"t4","label":"me"},{"id":"t5","label":"when"},{"id":"t6","label":"the"},{"id":"t7","label":"next"},{"id":"t8","label":"tour"},{"id":"t9","label":"starts?"},{"id":"t1","label":"Could"},{"id":"t2","label":"you"}]},"answer_key":{"value":["t1","t2","t3","t4","t5","t6","t7","t8","t9"]},"reference_answer":["t1","t2","t3","t4","t5","t6","t7","t8","t9"],"incorrect_answer":["t2","t3","t4","t5","t6","t7","t8","t9","t1"],"explanation":"Внутри when the next tour starts сохраняется прямой порядок слов."},{"id":"b090181e-9292-5579-981f-1ea16ab26bee","lesson_id":"24bb7028-2dc2-5579-9086-1e410fcf2015","kind":"correction","prompt":"Исправь только ошибку в конструкции, сохраняя остальные слова и смысл.","position":4,"public_payload":{"sentence":"Do you know where is the side entrance?"},"answer_key":{"accepted":["Do you know where the side entrance is?"]},"reference_answer":"Do you know where the side entrance is?","incorrect_answer":"Do you know where is the side entrance?","explanation":"В косвенной части нужно the side entrance is, а не вопросительная инверсия."},{"id":"ef79053f-942f-5b33-8c29-93b9756561ec","lesson_id":"24bb7028-2dc2-5579-9086-1e410fcf2015","kind":"reading","prompt":"Где расположен кабинет?","position":5,"public_payload":{"passage":"On his first day at college, Amir could not find the language office. He asked a receptionist, “Could you tell me where the language office is?” She explained that it was upstairs, beside the library. Amir also asked whether he needed an appointment. She said that students could come without one before noon, but appointments were required in the afternoon.","options":[{"id":"vb822549fad10","label":"Downstairs, inside the library."},{"id":"v2dadddca2020","label":"Outside the college entrance."},{"id":"vf1b3b949259f","label":"Upstairs, beside the library."}]},"answer_key":{"value":"vf1b3b949259f"},"reference_answer":"vf1b3b949259f","incorrect_answer":"vb822549fad10","explanation":"Сотрудница назвала этаж и ориентир beside the library."},{"id":"e38d3713-befd-55b1-bf33-ab1a521309cf","lesson_id":"24bb7028-2dc2-5579-9086-1e410fcf2015","kind":"reading","prompt":"Когда студент может прийти без записи?","position":6,"public_payload":{"passage":"On his first day at college, Amir could not find the language office. He asked a receptionist, “Could you tell me where the language office is?” She explained that it was upstairs, beside the library. Amir also asked whether he needed an appointment. She said that students could come without one before noon, but appointments were required in the afternoon.","options":[{"id":"vbc851a6070df","label":"Only after the library closes."},{"id":"vc016775372e3","label":"Before noon."},{"id":"vc3873821b855","label":"At any time in the afternoon."}]},"answer_key":{"value":"vc016775372e3"},"reference_answer":"vc016775372e3","incorrect_answer":"vc3873821b855","explanation":"До полудня запись не нужна; после полудня требуется."},{"id":"f9a63724-f70e-5fc9-a747-4636c2a30f89","lesson_id":"24bb7028-2dc2-5579-9086-1e410fcf2015","kind":"dialogue","prompt":"Выбери вопрос с правильным порядком слов после how much.","position":7,"public_payload":{"lines":[{"speaker":"Собеседник","text":"You want to ask politely about the fee."}],"options":[{"id":"v0855ae10503b","label":"Could you tell me how much does the course cost?"},{"id":"vaa7744461efc","label":"Could you tell me how much cost the course?"},{"id":"vc79b89466a43","label":"Could you tell me how much the course costs?"}]},"answer_key":{"value":"vc79b89466a43"},"reference_answer":"vc79b89466a43","incorrect_answer":"v0855ae10503b","explanation":"Косвенная часть — the course costs, без does."},{"id":"1c29c783-659a-5327-a159-3702ea211338","lesson_id":"24bb7028-2dc2-5579-9086-1e410fcf2015","kind":"context_choice","prompt":"Выбери слово, точно соответствующее контексту.","position":8,"public_payload":{"sentence":"The receptionist gave me clear ___ to the language office.","options":[{"id":"vdbb946f234b4","label":"appointments"},{"id":"vb43112990ff2","label":"directions"},{"id":"ve4a84693a5c1","label":"entrances"}]},"answer_key":{"value":"vb43112990ff2"},"reference_answer":"vb43112990ff2","incorrect_answer":"ve4a84693a5c1","explanation":"Directions здесь означает объяснение пути, а не сами входы или записи."},{"id":"07294629-9829-54f9-8963-0ee1c271948f","lesson_id":"49f1902c-6e6c-54df-9200-748b218c537d","kind":"single_choice","prompt":"Выбери точный вариант: There are two routes. Each requires a transfer, so ___ route is direct.","position":1,"public_payload":{"options":[{"id":"v40023a8bdbde","label":"both"},{"id":"v157625b0d362","label":"every of"},{"id":"v5481a4ca9519","label":"neither"}]},"answer_key":{"value":"v5481a4ca9519"},"reference_answer":"v5481a4ca9519","incorrect_answer":"v40023a8bdbde","explanation":"Из двух вариантов ни один не прямой: neither route is direct."},{"id":"8624d685-b2bc-56fa-a7ef-40525afe8603","lesson_id":"49f1902c-6e6c-54df-9200-748b218c537d","kind":"gap","prompt":"Вставь подходящее слово из пары: Both / Neither.","position":2,"public_payload":{"sentence":"I checked two timetables. ___ of them show the same departure time."},"answer_key":{"accepted":["Both"]},"reference_answer":"Both","incorrect_answer":"Neither","explanation":"Show во множественном числе и одинаковые сведения в двух расписаниях требуют Both."},{"id":"8fa2ca4f-0fb3-54eb-821e-770e57dd2ffe","lesson_id":"49f1902c-6e6c-54df-9200-748b218c537d","kind":"sentence","prompt":"Собери предложение: «Оба маршрута проходят через центральный рынок.»","position":3,"public_payload":{"tokens":[{"id":"t3","label":"pass"},{"id":"t4","label":"the"},{"id":"t5","label":"central"},{"id":"t6","label":"market."},{"id":"t1","label":"Both"},{"id":"t2","label":"routes"}]},"answer_key":{"value":["t1","t2","t3","t4","t5","t6"]},"reference_answer":["t1","t2","t3","t4","t5","t6"],"incorrect_answer":["t2","t3","t4","t5","t6","t1"],"explanation":"Both routes — подлежащее во множественном числе."},{"id":"8bf03f4d-4874-5dfb-b1fd-c7950c3ddf74","lesson_id":"49f1902c-6e6c-54df-9200-748b218c537d","kind":"correction","prompt":"Исправь только ошибку в конструкции, сохраняя остальные слова и смысл. Используй формальное согласование из пояснения урока.","position":4,"public_payload":{"sentence":"Neither of the two buses are direct."},"answer_key":{"accepted":["Neither of the two buses is direct."]},"reference_answer":"Neither of the two buses is direct.","incorrect_answer":"Neither of the two buses are direct.","explanation":"В заданном формальном варианте neither сочетается с is; разговорное are встречается, но здесь требуется формальная редакция."},{"id":"aed25cbc-8f15-5aa2-949c-5c8c64e293a0","lesson_id":"49f1902c-6e6c-54df-9200-748b218c537d","kind":"reading","prompt":"Что общего у маршрутов?","position":5,"public_payload":{"passage":"Eli compared two bus routes to the museum. Both routes passed the central market, but neither went directly to the museum. The first required a transfer near the station; the second required one outside the hospital. Eli chose the first because he knew the station well. It was not the fastest option, but he felt more confident about finding the connecting bus.","options":[{"id":"ve78188657d13","label":"Both require a transfer outside the hospital."},{"id":"vef6ec54160fb","label":"Both pass the central market."},{"id":"v658eff39073d","label":"Both go directly to the museum."}]},"answer_key":{"value":"vef6ec54160fb"},"reference_answer":"vef6ec54160fb","incorrect_answer":"v658eff39073d","explanation":"Оба проходят рынок; пересадки находятся в разных местах."},{"id":"2c6e4d09-a257-5f02-97fc-9f19b6a5d60f","lesson_id":"49f1902c-6e6c-54df-9200-748b218c537d","kind":"reading","prompt":"Почему Эли выбрал первый маршрут?","position":6,"public_payload":{"passage":"Eli compared two bus routes to the museum. Both routes passed the central market, but neither went directly to the museum. The first required a transfer near the station; the second required one outside the hospital. Eli chose the first because he knew the station well. It was not the fastest option, but he felt more confident about finding the connecting bus.","options":[{"id":"v4fcb8ff2e1f5","label":"He was familiar with the station."},{"id":"vbc28e0a39796","label":"It was definitely the fastest."},{"id":"v918ceddaac45","label":"It required no transfer."}]},"answer_key":{"value":"v4fcb8ff2e1f5"},"reference_answer":"v4fcb8ff2e1f5","incorrect_answer":"vbc28e0a39796","explanation":"Причина — знакомое место пересадки; текст прямо отрицает наибольшую скорость."},{"id":"1126120e-5f6f-5c82-a497-ca0a41278432","lesson_id":"49f1902c-6e6c-54df-9200-748b218c537d","kind":"dialogue","prompt":"Ответь, что ни один из двух поездов там не останавливается.","position":7,"public_payload":{"lines":[{"speaker":"Собеседник","text":"Do either of these trains stop at Oak Street?"}],"options":[{"id":"v36138481296a","label":"No, every of them stops there."},{"id":"va1100ebc5675","label":"No, neither of them stops there."},{"id":"v7f409a0144ec","label":"No, both of them stop there."}]},"answer_key":{"value":"va1100ebc5675"},"reference_answer":"va1100ebc5675","incorrect_answer":"v7f409a0144ec","explanation":"Neither of them передаёт отрицание обоих вариантов без двойного отрицания."},{"id":"4aab8d93-0c45-5a90-95e5-c932f1ef0ca7","lesson_id":"49f1902c-6e6c-54df-9200-748b218c537d","kind":"context_choice","prompt":"Выбери слово, точно соответствующее контексту.","position":8,"public_payload":{"sentence":"A journey with no change of bus is a ___ journey.","options":[{"id":"v45393aa0dda7","label":"direct"},{"id":"v0d29d0cd3b0c","label":"connecting"},{"id":"v188ff460a2e6","label":"delayed"}]},"answer_key":{"value":"v45393aa0dda7"},"reference_answer":"v45393aa0dda7","incorrect_answer":"v0d29d0cd3b0c","explanation":"Direct означает без пересадки; connecting предполагает стыковку."},{"id":"3905ec45-459a-5a1b-ae47-761883cab514","lesson_id":"0bfc327d-e509-51ba-ba8e-d75b34ca9fbe","kind":"single_choice","prompt":"Выбери точный вариант: “Please close the door,” the technician said to us. He asked us ___ the door.","position":1,"public_payload":{"options":[{"id":"v8886699785b2","label":"close to"},{"id":"vde95310b1305","label":"to close"},{"id":"vad952bf07a9f","label":"closing"}]},"answer_key":{"value":"vde95310b1305"},"reference_answer":"vde95310b1305","incorrect_answer":"vad952bf07a9f","explanation":"В конструкции asked us to close нужен to-infinitive."},{"id":"8e273126-8e8c-55a2-8695-c039b4146817","lesson_id":"0bfc327d-e509-51ba-ba8e-d75b34ca9fbe","kind":"gap","prompt":"Вставь подходящее слово из пары: not / no.","position":2,"public_payload":{"sentence":"The guide asked the visitors ___ to use flash photography."},"answer_key":{"accepted":["not"]},"reference_answer":"not","incorrect_answer":"no","explanation":"Отрицательная просьба строится asked someone not to do something."},{"id":"466b1627-5919-52d6-9b42-28f390c1aca8","lesson_id":"0bfc327d-e509-51ba-ba8e-d75b34ca9fbe","kind":"sentence","prompt":"Собери предложение: «Техник попросил нас не отключать компьютер от сети.»","position":3,"public_payload":{"tokens":[{"id":"t3","label":"asked"},{"id":"t4","label":"us"},{"id":"t5","label":"not"},{"id":"t6","label":"to"},{"id":"t7","label":"unplug"},{"id":"t8","label":"the"},{"id":"t9","label":"computer."},{"id":"t1","label":"The"},{"id":"t2","label":"technician"}]},"answer_key":{"value":["t1","t2","t3","t4","t5","t6","t7","t8","t9"]},"reference_answer":["t1","t2","t3","t4","t5","t6","t7","t8","t9"],"incorrect_answer":["t2","t3","t4","t5","t6","t7","t8","t9","t1"],"explanation":"Not стоит перед to unplug и относится к действию, которого просят избежать."},{"id":"7f342ba6-19de-5355-b36e-3c7e89051774","lesson_id":"0bfc327d-e509-51ba-ba8e-d75b34ca9fbe","kind":"correction","prompt":"Исправь только ошибку в конструкции, сохраняя остальные слова и смысл.","position":4,"public_payload":{"sentence":"She asked me bring my student card."},"answer_key":{"accepted":["She asked me to bring my student card."]},"reference_answer":"She asked me to bring my student card.","incorrect_answer":"She asked me bring my student card.","explanation":"После asked me для передачи просьбы нужен to bring."},{"id":"6e66a558-484b-565d-b134-75099dff3beb","lesson_id":"0bfc327d-e509-51ba-ba8e-d75b34ca9fbe","kind":"reading","prompt":"Чего техник попросила не делать?","position":5,"public_payload":{"passage":"Before the workshop, a technician checked the computers. She asked the students to keep drinks away from the desks. She also asked them not to unplug any cables. When one screen went dark, Ben remembered the request and called her instead of changing the cables himself. The technician found a loose connection and thanked him for waiting for help.","options":[{"id":"v822ecfe2b34e","label":"Unplug any cables."},{"id":"v5539d16e35a6","label":"Call her when there was a problem."},{"id":"vb3b14903b99c","label":"Use the computers during the workshop."}]},"answer_key":{"value":"v822ecfe2b34e"},"reference_answer":"v822ecfe2b34e","incorrect_answer":"v5539d16e35a6","explanation":"Запрет в просьбе относится к отключению кабелей."},{"id":"75e63d09-b73d-5e08-a3d7-89caf5cf9787","lesson_id":"0bfc327d-e509-51ba-ba8e-d75b34ca9fbe","kind":"reading","prompt":"Как Бен поступил с тёмным экраном?","position":6,"public_payload":{"passage":"Before the workshop, a technician checked the computers. She asked the students to keep drinks away from the desks. She also asked them not to unplug any cables. When one screen went dark, Ben remembered the request and called her instead of changing the cables himself. The technician found a loose connection and thanked him for waiting for help.","options":[{"id":"vea288445b14f","label":"He unplugged every cable."},{"id":"v7cca00c94585","label":"He moved his drink onto the desk."},{"id":"v0ff19c82feaf","label":"He called the technician and waited."}]},"answer_key":{"value":"v0ff19c82feaf"},"reference_answer":"v0ff19c82feaf","incorrect_answer":"vea288445b14f","explanation":"Бен сообщил о проблеме, сохранив оборудование как было."},{"id":"c76987fa-b3f5-5ab7-be05-1c63ffc1e6ce","lesson_id":"0bfc327d-e509-51ba-ba8e-d75b34ca9fbe","kind":"dialogue","prompt":"Передай отрицательную просьбу стандартной конструкцией.","position":7,"public_payload":{"lines":[{"speaker":"Собеседник","text":"Please do not move this box, the organiser told me."}],"options":[{"id":"v8f2591a3f9b6","label":"The organiser asked me not to move the box."},{"id":"v19c8766bd9a4","label":"The organiser asked me to not moving the box."},{"id":"va421e50af897","label":"The organiser asked to me moved the box."}]},"answer_key":{"value":"v8f2591a3f9b6"},"reference_answer":"v8f2591a3f9b6","incorrect_answer":"v19c8766bd9a4","explanation":"Asked me not to move сохраняет адресата и отрицание."},{"id":"b9565b61-cf0d-5217-952b-75c943de7526","lesson_id":"0bfc327d-e509-51ba-ba8e-d75b34ca9fbe","kind":"context_choice","prompt":"Выбери слово, точно соответствующее контексту.","position":8,"public_payload":{"sentence":"You should obtain ___ before using someone else’s equipment.","options":[{"id":"vceff27883924","label":"prediction"},{"id":"va12a7ad936eb","label":"departure"},{"id":"v6cb2bd60207d","label":"permission"}]},"answer_key":{"value":"v6cb2bd60207d"},"reference_answer":"v6cb2bd60207d","incorrect_answer":"vceff27883924","explanation":"Permission — разрешение на действие; остальные слова не выражают согласие владельца."},{"id":"75474bf6-fb82-59b9-9a93-93d2e492f8b6","lesson_id":"e14d541f-1b76-58c2-b750-789cc15178f9","kind":"single_choice","prompt":"Выбери точный вариант: I found an old key. ___ key had a red label.","position":1,"public_payload":{"options":[{"id":"v0f8ebc38f41f","label":"The"},{"id":"vbd2b0c46136f","label":"An"},{"id":"v535a53379fd2","label":"A of"}]},"answer_key":{"value":"v0f8ebc38f41f"},"reference_answer":"v0f8ebc38f41f","incorrect_answer":"vbd2b0c46136f","explanation":"Второе упоминание того же ключа требует the."},{"id":"6ecaf890-37f8-5baa-be92-bd73e98e11bc","lesson_id":"e14d541f-1b76-58c2-b750-789cc15178f9","kind":"gap","prompt":"Вставь подходящее слово из пары: a / an.","position":2,"public_payload":{"sentence":"She bought ___ useful guide to local plants."},"answer_key":{"accepted":["a"]},"reference_answer":"a","incorrect_answer":"an","explanation":"Useful начинается с согласного звука /j/, поэтому a useful guide."},{"id":"1b30fe27-52f8-539a-9e93-5a46010adb96","lesson_id":"e14d541f-1b76-58c2-b750-789cc15178f9","kind":"sentence","prompt":"Собери предложение: «Возле двери лежал какой-то зонт.»","position":3,"public_payload":{"tokens":[{"id":"t3","label":"was"},{"id":"t4","label":"lying"},{"id":"t5","label":"beside"},{"id":"t6","label":"the"},{"id":"t7","label":"door."},{"id":"t1","label":"An"},{"id":"t2","label":"umbrella"}]},"answer_key":{"value":["t1","t2","t3","t4","t5","t6","t7"]},"reference_answer":["t1","t2","t3","t4","t5","t6","t7"],"incorrect_answer":["t2","t3","t4","t5","t6","t7","t1"],"explanation":"An вводит один впервые упоминаемый зонт; umbrella начинается с гласного звука."},{"id":"032f8ce7-0e5b-55d4-8d48-97e9db1b8f7b","lesson_id":"e14d541f-1b76-58c2-b750-789cc15178f9","kind":"correction","prompt":"Исправь только ошибку в конструкции, сохраняя остальные слова и смысл.","position":4,"public_payload":{"sentence":"He found a envelope in the drawer."},"answer_key":{"accepted":["He found an envelope in the drawer."]},"reference_answer":"He found an envelope in the drawer.","incorrect_answer":"He found a envelope in the drawer.","explanation":"Envelope начинается с гласного звука, поэтому an envelope."},{"id":"617cb9b6-408d-5f0d-8ca3-59a315221fee","lesson_id":"e14d541f-1b76-58c2-b750-789cc15178f9","kind":"reading","prompt":"Что находилось в конверте?","position":5,"public_payload":{"passage":"While cleaning a desk, Sara found an envelope in a drawer. The envelope contained a photograph and a small note. The note had no name, but the photograph showed the previous owner of the desk. Sara contacted the shop where she had bought it. The shop agreed to pass a message to the owner, without sharing the owner’s personal details.","options":[{"id":"v76411cde575c","label":"A key and an umbrella."},{"id":"v807ac75e210a","label":"The shop owner’s private address."},{"id":"v1ed9e4245b38","label":"A photograph and a small note."}]},"answer_key":{"value":"v1ed9e4245b38"},"reference_answer":"v1ed9e4245b38","incorrect_answer":"v76411cde575c","explanation":"Содержимое перечислено во втором предложении."},{"id":"70f5107c-23bb-5bd5-9bc5-e127db08e9d5","lesson_id":"e14d541f-1b76-58c2-b750-789cc15178f9","kind":"reading","prompt":"Что магазин согласился сделать?","position":6,"public_payload":{"passage":"While cleaning a desk, Sara found an envelope in a drawer. The envelope contained a photograph and a small note. The note had no name, but the photograph showed the previous owner of the desk. Sara contacted the shop where she had bought it. The shop agreed to pass a message to the owner, without sharing the owner’s personal details.","options":[{"id":"v49e0ba352ce6"