647fa429-7942-51bc-837d-6ff0dcb538b4","kind":"reading","prompt":"При каком условии организатор собирался отменить прогулку?","position":5,"public_payload":{"passage":"A walking group planned a trip to a lake. The forecast mentioned strong winds, but no rain. The organiser said that they would go unless the wind became dangerous. Everyone was asked to bring warm clothes and water. On the morning of the trip, conditions were calm. The group went ahead with the walk and checked the forecast again before leaving the village.","options":[{"id":"v683e4e6ff4de","label":"If the forecast mentioned no rain."},{"id":"v3beb23b2fe11","label":"If the wind became dangerous."},{"id":"vf425e0fa5df6","label":"If anyone brought warm clothes."}]},"answer_key":{"value":"v3beb23b2fe11"},"reference_answer":"v3beb23b2fe11","incorrect_answer":"vf425e0fa5df6","explanation":"Unless вводит опасный ветер как исключение из плана поездки."},{"id":"2ccaf953-9eac-5fb1-ba1d-a86a2ae693a9","lesson_id":"647fa429-7942-51bc-837d-6ff0dcb538b4","kind":"reading","prompt":"Что говорится о погоде утром?","position":6,"public_payload":{"passage":"A walking group planned a trip to a lake. The forecast mentioned strong winds, but no rain. The organiser said that they would go unless the wind became dangerous. Everyone was asked to bring warm clothes and water. On the morning of the trip, conditions were calm. The group went ahead with the walk and checked the forecast again before leaving the village.","options":[{"id":"vcf4f0f6e07c9","label":"Conditions were calm."},{"id":"vd557f212cf27","label":"Dangerous winds had already started."},{"id":"v7b4a7b311537","label":"It was snowing heavily."}]},"answer_key":{"value":"vcf4f0f6e07c9"},"reference_answer":"vcf4f0f6e07c9","incorrect_answer":"vd557f212cf27","explanation":"Calm прямо описывает утренние условия; сильный ветер был лишь риском."},{"id":"1fbb3a5e-efe1-5909-9be8-8f3b12a3af63","lesson_id":"647fa429-7942-51bc-837d-6ff0dcb538b4","kind":"dialogue","prompt":"Выбе