."},"answer_key":{"accepted":["would"]},"reference_answer":"would","incorrect_answer":"will","explanation":"Прошлое условие соединено с гипотетическим настоящим через would be staying."},{"id":"199ab5f8-0337-5d85-bf14-aad4f7141a53","lesson_id":"5ebcf706-6786-5ede-956f-069abdd41682","kind":"sentence","prompt":"Собери предложение: «Если бы она тогда приняла предложение, сейчас она жила бы за границей.»","position":3,"public_payload":{"tokens":[{"id":"t3","label":"had"},{"id":"t4","label":"accepted"},{"id":"t5","label":"the"},{"id":"t6","label":"offer,"},{"id":"t7","label":"she"},{"id":"t8","label":"would"},{"id":"t9","label":"live"},{"id":"t10","label":"abroad"},{"id":"t11","label":"now."},{"id":"t1","label":"If"},{"id":"t2","label":"she"}]},"answer_key":{"value":["t1","t2","t3","t4","t5","t6","t7","t8","t9","t10","t11"]},"reference_answer":["t1","t2","t3","t4","t5","t6","t7","t8","t9","t10","t11"],"incorrect_answer":["t2","t3","t4","t5","t6","t7","t8","t9","t10","t11","t1"],"explanation":"Had accepted — прошлое решение; would live now — нынешняя ситуация."},{"id":"074ee206-6616-5cd7-bb8e-4c8f56c750a9","lesson_id":"5ebcf706-6786-5ede-956f-069abdd41682","kind":"correction","prompt":"Исправь только ошибку в конструкции, сохраняя остальные слова и смысл.","position":4,"public_payload":{"sentence":"If I had charged my phone, it will work now."},"answer_key":{"accepted":["If I had charged my phone, it would work now."]},"reference_answer":"If I had charged my phone, it would work now.","incorrect_answer":"If I had charged my phone, it will work now.","explanation":"Гипотетический нынешний результат требует would work."},{"id":"85db9f49-3c9b-5e9a-94b4-4c51b12dfe75","lesson_id":"5ebcf706-6786-5ede-956f-069abdd41682","kind":"reading","prompt":"Какое время имеет результат в цитате Лены?","position":5,"public_payload":{"passage":"A year ago, Lena turned down a place on an overseas training programme because she wanted to finish a local project. That project has now ended, and she is looking for a new position. She wonders whether accepting the training place would have given her useful contacts. She says, “If I had gone, I would know more people in that field now.” This is a possibility she imagines, not evidence that the programme would certainly have led to a job.","options":[{"id":"v7d840ae1237d","label":"An imagined situation in the present."},{"id":"vd64de0f2512e","label":"A confirmed event before she rejected the place."},{"id":"vdcf61eb45ca4","label":"A promise about next year."}]},"answer_key":{"value":"v7d840ae1237d"},"reference_answer":"v7d840ae1237d","incorrect_answer":"vd64de0f2512e","explanation":"Now указывает на нынешнее знание людей как воображаемый результат прошлого выбора."},{"id":"f039de71-b10a-5772-bfdb-ca14a8fd89e4","lesson_id":"5ebcf706-6786-5ede-956f-069abdd41682","kind":"reading","prompt":"Какой вывод был бы слишком сильным?","position":6,"public_payload":{"passage":"A year ago, Lena turned down a place on an overseas training programme because she wanted to finish a local project. That project has now ended, and she is looking for a new position. She wonders whether accepting the training place would have given her useful contacts. She says, “If I had gone, I would know more people in that field now.” This is a possibility she imagines, not evidence that the programme would certainly have led to a job.","options":[{"id":"vc5211c49c055","label":"Lena rejected the training place a year ago."},{"id":"v7230afe3f189","label":"Her local project has ended."},{"id":"vc234b66025bb","label":"The programme would definitely have secured her a job."}]},"answer_key":{"value":"vc234b66025bb"},"reference_answer":"vc234b66025bb","incorrect_answer":"vc5211c49c055","explanation":"Текст прямо отличает возможные контакты от гарантированного трудоустройства."},{"id":"4829556d-267e-5463-b1cb-6de57e161041","lesson_id":"5ebcf706-6786-5ede-956f-069abdd41682","kind":"dialogue","prompt":"Свяжи несостоявшееся прошлое обучение с нынешней возможностью.","position":7,"public_payload":{"lines":[{"speaker":"Собеседник","text":"Do you regret not learning to drive earlier?"}],"options":[{"id":"v26f2b2f47e15","label":"Yes. If I had learnt earlier, I could drive us there now."},{"id":"v7ed0adf28aef","label":"Yes. If I learn yesterday, I can drove now."},{"id":"v2c798e4ebb43","label":"Yes. If I had learnt earlier, I drove us yesterday now."}]},"answer_key":{"value":"v26f2b2f47e15"},"reference_answer":"v26f2b2f47e15","incorrect_answer":"v7ed0adf28aef","explanation":"Had learnt и could drive now связывают прошлое условие и настоящее умение."},{"id":"71e7842a-7824-59ff-b770-79d7e0792548","lesson_id":"5ebcf706-6786-5ede-956f-069abdd41682","kind":"context_choice","prompt":"Выбери слово, точно соответствующее контексту.","position":8,"public_payload":{"sentence":"The loss of the file was a ___ of not keeping a backup.","options":[{"id":"v4049863164be","label":"precaution"},{"id":"v60c16dba3638","label":"rehearsal"},{"id":"v21da2331d8e3","label":"consequence"}]},"answer_key":{"value":"v21da2331d8e3"},"reference_answer":"v21da2331d8e3","incorrect_answer":"v4049863164be","explanation":"Consequence — последствие; precaution — предупреждающая мера."},{"id":"f453ae2f-baa9-5204-b258-d1b319d8c0ce","lesson_id":"59dc13df-e083-5bc6-a786-0ddc9d60a8c7","kind":"single_choice","prompt":"Выбери точный вариант: The deadline passed yesterday. I wish I ___ the form sooner.","position":1,"public_payload":{"options":[{"id":"v7064aefac455","label":"had submitted"},{"id":"v970a0fe0bdd7","label":"submit"},{"id":"v6b66792f7529","label":"will submit"}]},"answer_key":{"value":"v7064aefac455"},"reference_answer":"v7064aefac455","incorrect_answer":"v970a0fe0bdd7","explanation":"Завершённое прошлое требует had submitted после wish."},{"id":"f126f16d-6327-5fe6-8cea-59746675dea0","lesson_id":"59dc13df-e083-5bc6-a786-0ddc9d60a8c7","kind":"gap","prompt":"Вставь подходящее слово из пары: read / reading.","position":2,"public_payload":{"sentence":"She wishes she had ___ the instructions more carefully."},"answer_key":{"accepted":["read"]},"reference_answer":"read","incorrect_answer":"reading","explanation":"После had требуется причастие read; его написание совпадает с инфинитивом."},{"id":"83b7d992-fa4b-5b63-bd76-92c49e2c14c2","lesson_id":"59dc13df-e083-5bc6-a786-0ddc9d60a8c7","kind":"sentence","prompt":"Собери предложение: «Жаль, что я не проверил дату отправления.»","position":3,"public_payload":{"tokens":[{"id":"t3","label":"I"},{"id":"t4","label":"had"},{"id":"t5","label":"checked"},{"id":"t6","label":"the"},{"id":"t7","label":"departure"},{"id":"t8","label":"date."},{"id":"t1","label":"I"},{"id":"t2","label":"wish"}]},"answer_key":{"value":["t1","t2","t3","t4","t5","t6","t7","t8"]},"reference_answer":["t1","t2","t3","t4","t5","t6","t7","t8"],"incorrect_answer":["t2","t3","t4","t5","t6","t7","t8","t1"],"explanation":"Had checked после wish описывает действие в прошлом, которого не было."},{"id":"00128ca9-6b5c-59ef-8b04-6676ff7b4e5d","lesson_id":"59dc13df-e083-5bc6-a786-0ddc9d60a8c7","kind":"correction","prompt":"Исправь только ошибку в конструкции, сохраняя остальные слова и смысл.","position":4,"public_payload":{"sentence":"He wishes he has saved the receipt last week."},"answer_key":{"accepted":["He wishes he had saved the receipt last week."]},"reference_answer":"He wishes he had saved the receipt last week.","incorrect_answer":"He wishes he has saved the receipt last week.","explanation":"Last week указывает на прошлое сожаление: had saved."},{"id":"34f018e4-811e-58eb-924c-e39898a53cc9","lesson_id":"59dc13df-e083-5bc6-a786-0ddc9d60a8c7","kind":"reading","prompt":"Какую ошибку сделал Ноа?","position":5,"public_payload":{"passage":"Noah booked a workshop after reading a short announcement on his phone. He noticed the venue but overlooked the date. When he arrived a week late, the building was closed. He wished he had opened the full booking confirmation instead of relying on the announcement. The organiser offered him a place at a later workshop, but the original fee could not be refunded under the terms he had accepted. Noah decided to add future bookings to his calendar immediately.","options":[{"id":"vd1c73a96d8b7","label":"He deliberately booked a closed building."},{"id":"v5c0d8a88f57b","label":"He arrived a week before the workshop."},{"id":"v19e82dca1ba6","label":"He overlooked the workshop date."}]},"answer_key":{"value":"v19e82dca1ba6"},"reference_answer":"v19e82dca1ba6","incorrect_answer":"vd1c73a96d8b7","explanation":"Он не заметил дату и пришёл на неделю позже."},{"id":"983fead0-aab1-5a84-b676-2b2162c8a34c","lesson_id":"59dc13df-e083-5bc6-a786-0ddc9d60a8c7","kind":"reading","prompt":"Что организатор предложил вместо возврата?","position":6,"public_payload":{"passage":"Noah booked a workshop after reading a short announcement on his phone. He noticed the venue but overlooked the date. When he arrived a week late, the building was closed. He wished he had opened the full booking confirmation instead of relying on the announcement. The organiser offered him a place at a later workshop, but the original fee could not be refunded under the terms he had accepted. Noah decided to add future bookings to his calendar immediately.","options":[{"id":"v9d62178a7edb","label":"A free trip to the original venue."},{"id":"vd03795ae2ae3","label":"A place at a later workshop."},{"id":"v7d22bb172e54","label":"A guaranteed cash refund."}]},"answer_key":{"value":"vd03795ae2ae3"},"reference_answer":"vd03795ae2ae3","incorrect_answer":"v7d22bb172e54","explanation":"Предложение касалось другого занятия; возврат исходной суммы был исключён условиями."},{"id":"689d695d-2e71-5907-a131-4c009ffa08ea","lesson_id":"59dc13df-e083-5bc6-a786-0ddc9d60a8c7","kind":"dialogue","prompt":"Вырази сожаление о непроверенном расписании.","position":7,"public_payload":{"lines":[{"speaker":"Собеседник","text":"I missed the last bus because I did not check the timetable."}],"options":[{"id":"v495585c3ef9