.","options":[{"id":"v33899800d6a8","label":"Completing every future museum exhibition."},{"id":"vd9c5d06bcd6c","label":"Preparing the labels."},{"id":"v9f153a486911","label":"Welcoming the first Friday visitors."}]},"answer_key":{"value":"vd9c5d06bcd6c"},"reference_answer":"vd9c5d06bcd6c","incorrect_answer":"v9f153a486911","explanation":"По графику к этому времени будут готовы подписи."},{"id":"12bd88e8-2e15-5afd-82ca-551290158be2","lesson_id":"311c6dc5-d463-59cf-a03d-32a78af0d2ce","kind":"reading","prompt":"Гарантирует ли готовность подписей открытие выставки?","position":6,"public_payload":{"passage":"The museum team has three days to prepare a temporary exhibition. The paintings are already in place, but the labels still need to be printed. According to the current schedule, the team will have completed the labels by noon on Thursday. A separate safety inspection is planned for Thursday afternoon. The exhibition can open on Friday only if that inspection is successful. Finishing the labels is therefore an important milestone, but it is not the only condition for opening.","options":[{"id":"vef17447307fa","label":"No; the safety inspection must also succeed."},{"id":"v81e802b57f47","label":"Yes; no other conditions remain."},{"id":"vf63e1dbcf02c","label":"No; the paintings have not arrived."}]},"answer_key":{"value":"vef17447307fa"},"reference_answer":"vef17447307fa","incorrect_answer":"v81e802b57f47","explanation":"Текст вводит отдельное условие — успешную проверку безопасности."},{"id":"27024a10-d2b0-5a9e-8196-8f94523b4b2e","lesson_id":"311c6dc5-d463-59cf-a03d-32a78af0d2ce","kind":"dialogue","prompt":"Подтверди завершение отправки к будущему моменту.","position":7,"public_payload":{"lines":[{"speaker":"Собеседник","text":"Will the report be ready before the meeting starts?"}],"options":[{"id":"v1e219954adfa","label":"Yes, we have send it tomorrow."},{"id":"vc0bb7de53371","label":"Yes, we will have sent it by then."},{"id":"vcdaf4ff39ee8","label":"Yes, we will have sending it by then."}]},"answer_key":{"value":"vc0bb7de53371"},"reference_answer":"vc0bb7de53371","incorrect_answer":"vcdaf4ff39ee8","explanation":"Will have sent согласует завершённую отправку с by then."},{"id":"31758461-d00d-51b5-8f22-a04c8c8b6422","lesson_id":"311c6dc5-d463-59cf-a03d-32a78af0d2ce","kind":"context_choice","prompt":"Выбери слово, точно соответствующее контексту.","position":8,"public_payload":{"sentence":"A significant stage used to track progress is a ___.","options":[{"id":"v611ab425daf5","label":"milestone"},{"id":"v20aeff17337c","label":"distraction"},{"id":"va50326bca10d","label":"receipt"}]},"answer_key":{"value":"v611ab425daf5"},"reference_answer":"v611ab425daf5","incorrect_answer":"v20aeff17337c","explanation":"Milestone — контрольная точка, по которой отслеживают ход работы."},{"id":"9d7d6da7-653f-593b-b8e6-8b57635e280a","lesson_id":"f80cc913-eb26-5bee-a633-7d5095d1ba83","kind":"single_choice","prompt":"Выбери точный вариант: A technician fixed the screen for me. I ___ my screen repaired.","position":1,"public_payload":{"options":[{"id":"va1cebf5ec5fa","label":"was have"},{"id":"va1b908d1a7b9","label":"had"},{"id":"vfe60112498ad","label":"did"}]},"answer_key":{"value":"va1b908d1a7b9"},"reference_answer":"va1b908d1a7b9","incorrect_answer":"vfe60112498ad","explanation":"Had my screen repaired передаёт заказанную у специалиста услугу."},{"id":"e1411375-1802-5878-81aa-4717496b9750","lesson_id":"f80cc913-eb26-5bee-a633-7d5095d1ba83","kind":"gap","prompt":"Вставь подходящее слово из пары: inspected / inspect.","position":2,"public_payload":{"sentence":"We are having the roof ___ by a specialist."},"answer_key":{"accepted":["inspected"]},"reference_answer":"inspected","incorrect_answer":"inspect","explanation":"После объекта the roof в causative-конструкции требуется причастие inspected."},{"id":"0a7ec3fd-80ac-597f-a2e6-cadae6e69c62","lesson_id":"f80cc913-eb26-5bee-a633-7d5095d1ba83","kind":"sentence","prompt":"Собери предложение: «Перед пое