_answer":"v301dc1daa588","incorrect_answer":"v1d78082577aa","explanation":"Равенство выражается as large as, без сравнительной степени."},{"id":"cdd06009-9866-5848-8080-4a17220ccd6a","lesson_id":"099440a0-287a-54ae-9026-6635d2e1c4f7","kind":"gap","prompt":"Дополни предложение словом из пары: expensiver / expensive.","position":2,"public_payload":{"sentence":"This bag is as ___ as mine; they cost the same."},"answer_key":{"accepted":["expensive"]},"reference_answer":"expensive","incorrect_answer":"expensiver","explanation":"В as ... as нужна исходная форма expensive."},{"id":"8899ea8e-3620-5156-8c9f-bc98e989248c","lesson_id":"099440a0-287a-54ae-9026-6635d2e1c4f7","kind":"sentence","prompt":"Собери предложение: «Синяя комната не такая большая, как зелёная.»","position":3,"public_payload":{"tokens":[{"id":"t3","label":"room"},{"id":"t4","label":"is"},{"id":"t5","label":"not"},{"id":"t6","label":"as"},{"id":"t7","label":"large"},{"id":"t8","label":"as"},{"id":"t9","label":"the"},{"id":"t10","label":"green"},{"id":"t11","label":"room."},{"id":"t1","label":"The"},{"id":"t2","label":"blue"}]},"answer_key":{"value":["t1","t2","t3","t4","t5","t6","t7","t8","t9","t10","t11"]},"reference_answer":["t1","t2","t3","t4","t5","t6","t7","t8","t9","t10","t11"],"incorrect_answer":["t2","t3","t4","t5","t6","t7","t8","t9","t10","t11","t1"],"explanation":"Not as large as означает меньший размер синей комнаты."},{"id":"20e1e7c2-1a08-5c07-a2ae-f983adef6525","lesson_id":"099440a0-287a-54ae-9026-6635d2e1c4f7","kind":"correction","prompt":"Исправь указанную конструкцию, сохраняя остальные слова и смысл.","position":4,"public_payload":{"sentence":"This train is as faster as the other one."},"answer_key":{"accepted":["This train is as fast as the other one."]},"reference_answer":"This train is as fast as the other one.","incorrect_answer":"This train is as faster as the other one.","explanation":"Между as используется fast, а не faster."},{"id":"7d9fcc6d-8e71-5fda-ad68-cccee8204074","lesson_id"