-f09f-5cb0-8628-d5197ce146e9","kind":"context_choice","prompt":"Выбери слово по смыслу контекста.","position":9,"public_payload":{"sentence":"The room was unavailable, so we used the library ___.","options":[{"id":"v2ac3e5491938","label":"instead"},{"id":"vd03a4971d4ae","label":"because of"},{"id":"v7d45f7251792","label":"repaired"}]},"answer_key":{"value":"v2ac3e5491938"},"reference_answer":"v2ac3e5491938","incorrect_answer":"vd03a4971d4ae","explanation":"Instead обозначает выбранную замену."},{"id":"42f3ebfa-e6bf-5a5c-b74a-e717e5d971ab","lesson_id":"a5125231-2b9a-5d47-b10e-072407923bed","kind":"single_choice","prompt":"Выбери точный вариант: We printed larger labels so that everyone ___ read them.","position":1,"public_payload":{"options":[{"id":"v55143e5e546d","label":"for"},{"id":"v4b2633fbf95a","label":"could"},{"id":"vea2e39149a0f","label":"to"}]},"answer_key":{"value":"v4b2633fbf95a"},"reference_answer":"v4b2633fbf95a","incorrect_answer":"vea2e39149a0f","explanation":"После so that и подлежащего everyone нужен глагол could read."},{"id":"6fb228de-cc26-571e-bca9-54104d36dc8d","lesson_id":"a5125231-2b9a-5d47-b10e-072407923bed","kind":"gap","prompt":"Дополни предложение словом из пары: for / to.","position":2,"public_payload":{"sentence":"The group moved the chairs in order ___ create more space."},"answer_key":{"accepted":["to"]},"reference_answer":"to","incorrect_answer":"for","explanation":"In order to сочетается с начальной формой create."},{"id":"95b57057-e825-5a03-a9f6-6f34ce88365e","lesson_id":"a5125231-2b9a-5d47-b10e-072407923bed","kind":"sentence","prompt":"Собери предложение: «Мы говорили медленно, чтобы все могли понять объяснение.»","position":3,"public_payload":{"tokens":[{"id":"t3","label":"slowly"},{"id":"t4","label":"so"},{"id":"t5","label":"that"},{"id":"t6","label":"everyone"},{"id":"t7","label":"could"},{"id":"t8","label":"follow."},{"id":"t1","label":"We"},{"id":"t2","label":"spoke"}]},"answer_key":{"value":["t1","t2","t3","t4","t5","t6","t7","t8"]},"reference_answer":["t1","t2","t3","t4","t5","t6","t7","t8"],"incorrect_answer":["t2","t3","t4","t5","t6","t7","t8","t1"],"explanation":"So that вводит отдельное подлежащее everyone; цель относится к пониманию слушателей."},{"id":"ee37a486-015b-56f7-aaf1-d8726ca14a48","lesson_id":"a5125231-2b9a-5d47-b10e-072407923bed","kind":"correction","prompt":"Исправь указанную конструкцию, сохраняя остальные слова и смысл.","position":4,"public_payload":{"sentence":"She opened the side door in order make access easier."},"answer_key":{"accepted":["She opened the side door in order to make access easier."]},"reference_answer":"She opened the side door in order to make access easier.","incorrect_answer":"She opened the side door in order make access easier.","explanation":"После in order требуется to перед инфинитивом make."},{"id":"00ede4e9-6a49-5737-88d9-a870e9129535","lesson_id":"a5125231-2b9a-5d47-b10e-072407923bed","kind":"reading","prompt":"Зачем выступающих попросили говорить медленнее?","position":5,"public_payload":{"passage":"At a community workshop, the organiser noticed that some visitors could not read the small labels. She printed larger ones and moved a lamp nearer the table. She also asked speakers to slow down so that everyone could follow the instructions. These changes took only a few minutes, but visitors said they made the activity easier to join.","options":[{"id":"vb85f542e9c97","label":"So visitors could follow the instructions."},{"id":"ve5fed6b48310","label":"So the labels would become physically larger."},{"id":"va3a63403e347","label":"So the workshop would end immediately."}]},"answer_key":{"value":"vb85f542e9c97"},"reference_answer":"vb85f542e9c97","incorrect_answer":"ve5fed6b48310","explanation":"Цель названа после so that: понимание инструкций."},{"id":"2f7da890-e5df-5dd4-a46f-6029b177ee1c","lesson_id":"a5125231-2b9a-5d47-b10e-072407923bed","kind":"matching","prompt":"Соедини слова урока с переводом в указанном контексте.","position":6,"publ