 / practising.","position":2,"public_payload":{"sentence":"At seven yesterday, she was ___ the presentation."},"answer_key":{"accepted":["practising"]},"reference_answer":"practising","incorrect_answer":"practised","explanation":"После was для процесса нужна -ing-форма practising."},{"id":"d89ef143-e2d4-5646-9445-fe0daf40b8b8","lesson_id":"8c20c2fd-44cd-5e82-a09d-2e9fe09be70a","kind":"sentence","prompt":"Собери предложение: «Пока я готовил, они накрывали на стол.»","position":3,"public_payload":{"tokens":[{"id":"t3","label":"was"},{"id":"t4","label":"cooking,"},{"id":"t5","label":"they"},{"id":"t6","label":"were"},{"id":"t7","label":"setting"},{"id":"t8","label":"the"},{"id":"t9","label":"table."},{"id":"t1","label":"While"},{"id":"t2","label":"I"}]},"answer_key":{"value":["t1","t2","t3","t4","t5","t6","t7","t8","t9"]},"reference_answer":["t1","t2","t3","t4","t5","t6","t7","t8","t9"],"incorrect_answer":["t2","t3","t4","t5","t6","t7","t8","t9","t1"],"explanation":"Два Past Continuous показывают параллельные процессы."},{"id":"4d0924e3-78d9-5c87-9122-797cd541bbcb","lesson_id":"8c20c2fd-44cd-5e82-a09d-2e9fe09be70a","kind":"correction","prompt":"Исправь указанную конструкцию, сохраняя остальные слова и смысл.","position":4,"public_payload":{"sentence":"While we was cleaning, he was packing the tools."},"answer_key":{"accepted":["While we were cleaning, he was packing the tools."]},"reference_answer":"While we were cleaning, he was packing the tools.","incorrect_answer":"While we was cleaning, he was packing the tools.","explanation":"С we используется were; второй процесс с he was уже оформлен правильно."},{"id":"ceab04e5-ef99-5848-8158-7f0de9f81ecc","lesson_id":"8c20c2fd-44cd-5e82-a09d-2e9fe09be70a","kind":"reading","prompt":"Что делал Омар, пока Прия развешивала указатели?","position":5,"public_payload":{"passage":"The volunteers arrived early to prepare the hall. While Priya was putting signs on the doors, Omar was arranging chairs. Two other volunteers were checking the microphones. At eight, the first guest arrived and asked where to leave a coat. Priya stopped her work for a moment and showed him the cloakroom before returning to the signs.","options":[{"id":"vdb16d3b9a4a4","label":"Repairing the doors."},{"id":"v76cd7680046a","label":"Showing a guest the car park."},{"id":"v73f471c2ac3b","label":"Arranging chairs."}]},"answer_key":{"value":"v73f471c2ac3b"},"reference_answer":"v73f471c2ac3b","incorrect_answer":"vdb16d3b9a4a4","explanation":"Его параллельное действие прямо названо во второй фразе."},{"id":"9613d5f6-0074-5e6e-9039-e9f5ede71223","lesson_id":"8c20c2fd-44cd-5e82-a09d-2e9fe09be70a","kind":"matching","prompt":"Соедини слова урока с переводом в указанном контексте.","position":6,"public_payload":{"left":[{"id":"l2d491d9bf884","label":"meanwhile"},{"id":"lbac9557a99e1","label":"prepare"},{"id":"lef33571335f1","label":"set the table"},{"id":"l0343e7f0a678","label":"interrupt"}],"right":[{"id":"r75fb35a056b7","label":"накрывать на стол"},{"id":"r32b6d5563a5d","label":"прерывать"},{"id":"rd9b696d9e337","label":"тем временем"},{"id":"r831bd6311bbd","label":"готовить"}]},"answer_key":{"pairs":{"l2d491d9bf884":"rd9b696d9e337","lbac9557a99e1":"r831bd6311bbd","lef33571335f1":"r75fb35a056b7","l0343e7f0a678":"r32b6d5563a5d"}},"reference_answer":{"l2d491d9bf884":"rd9b696d9e337","lbac9557a99e1":"r831bd6311bbd","lef33571335f1":"r75fb35a056b7","l0343e7f0a678":"r32b6d5563a5d"},"incorrect_answer":{"l2d491d9bf884":"r831bd6311bbd","lbac9557a99e1":"rd9b696d9e337","lef33571335f1":"r75fb35a056b7","l0343e7f0a678":"r32b6d5563a5d"},"explanation":"В этих контекстах: meanwhile — тем временем; prepare — готовить; set the table — накрывать на стол; interrupt — прерывать."},{"id":"09564084-a93f-5881-8d4f-f6b589b0ddf2","lesson_id":"8c20c2fd-44cd-5e82-a09d-2e9fe09be70a","kind":"reading","prompt":"Какое событие ненадолго прервало работу Прии?","position":7,"public_payload":{"passage":"The volunteers arrived early to prepare the hall. While Priya wa