h had been renovated over the summer, would host the next public lecture. The relative clause supplied extra information about a hall already identified by name. In another sentence, “the hall that has a hearing loop” distinguished one of several possible venues. Removing that defining clause would make the reference less precise. The organiser checked both sentences because changing punctuation could change whether readers were being given background detail or being told which venue was meant.","options":[{"id":"vf77025ef86c5","label":"It distinguishes an unnamed hall solely by its hearing loop."},{"id":"vf23fa2446704","label":"It announces that every hall has been renovated."},{"id":"vd7df0d43c219","label":"It adds background information about Riverside Hall."}]},"answer_key":{"value":"vd7df0d43c219"},"reference_answer":"vd7df0d43c219","incorrect_answer":"vf77025ef86c5","explanation":"Название уже определяет зал; ремонт — дополнительный факт."},{"id":"a6c6634f-6d8d-5a92-ac12-6cad643c5209","lesson_id":"be6ba095-28c4-515e-a61a-209fe8491e14","kind":"matching","prompt":"Соедини слова урока с переводом в указанном контексте.","position":6,"public_payload":{"left":[{"id":"l52ceb8a30a1e","label":"additional"},{"id":"l6aa7612207ba","label":"identify"},{"id":"l81c0cf62f117","label":"renovation"},{"id":"laca9f66d666f","label":"capacity"}],"right":[{"id":"rc5ac554cd321","label":"ремонт, обновление"},{"id":"r12157ceb9dc5","label":"вместимость"},{"id":"rb0273641abc0","label":"дополнительный"},{"id":"r517f064d8e91","label":"определять, опознавать"}]},"answer_key":{"pairs":{"l52ceb8a30a1e":"rb0273641abc0","l6aa7612207ba":"r517f064d8e91","l81c0cf62f117":"rc5ac554cd321","laca9f66d666f":"r12157ceb9dc5"}},"reference_answer":{"l52ceb8a30a1e":"rb0273641abc0","l6aa7612207ba":"r517f064d8e91","l81c0cf62f117":"rc5ac554cd321","laca9f66d666f":"r12157ceb9dc5"},"incorrect_answer":{"l52ceb8a30a1e":"r517f064d8e91","l6aa7612207ba":"rb0273641abc0","l81c0cf62f117":"rc5ac554cd321","laca9f66d666f":"