value":"vcc4ed60ef2f8"},"reference_answer":"vcc4ed60ef2f8","incorrect_answer":"v02f20888059e","explanation":"Which используется в добавочной относительной части о зале."},{"id":"3e7156fe-ed95-5d7e-a84d-91477aec6864","lesson_id":"be6ba095-28c4-515e-a61a-209fe8491e14","kind":"context_choice","prompt":"Выбери слово по смыслу контекста.","position":9,"public_payload":{"sentence":"The maximum number of people a venue can hold is its ___.","options":[{"id":"v59776bb840d6","label":"reservation only"},{"id":"v37c99d0b3840","label":"capacity"},{"id":"v71782c1e0e47","label":"departure"}]},"answer_key":{"value":"v37c99d0b3840"},"reference_answer":"v37c99d0b3840","incorrect_answer":"v71782c1e0e47","explanation":"Capacity в этом контексте — вместимость помещения."},{"id":"a9482643-274f-5f98-b78f-eb4ddcd92f78","lesson_id":"43da37d8-8356-5ec2-9ce9-2b0a0a423662","kind":"single_choice","prompt":"Выбери точный вариант: You say I forgot, but I ___ send the form yesterday.","position":1,"public_payload":{"options":[{"id":"v9396b6664c50","label":"have did"},{"id":"v63f44d002679","label":"was do"},{"id":"vab8c16d7520d","label":"did"}]},"answer_key":{"value":"vab8c16d7520d"},"reference_answer":"vab8c16d7520d","incorrect_answer":"v9396b6664c50","explanation":"Did усиливает утверждение о вчерашней отправке; далее send."},{"id":"80f65f00-5f5d-5632-8118-d88c5a8d4318","lesson_id":"43da37d8-8356-5ec2-9ce9-2b0a0a423662","kind":"gap","prompt":"Дополни предложение словом из пары: does / do.","position":2,"public_payload":{"sentence":"She ___ recognise the problem, although she disagrees about the cause."},"answer_key":{"accepted":["does"]},"reference_answer":"does","incorrect_answer":"do","explanation":"С she в Present Simple усиление оформляется does recognise."},{"id":"68d26c9b-547d-546f-8e4c-76b23ae0d164","lesson_id":"43da37d8-8356-5ec2-9ce9-2b0a0a423662","kind":"sentence","prompt":"Собери предложение: «Я действительно отправил сообщение вчера.»","position":3,"public_payload":{"tokens":[{"id":"