,"options":[{"id":"vef4f9f02a672","label":"Yes, we have a few minutes."},{"id":"v397b6aab3275","label":"Yes, we have a little minutes."},{"id":"vcedd56ea8fb9","label":"Yes, we has a few minute."}]},"answer_key":{"value":"vef4f9f02a672"},"reference_answer":"vef4f9f02a672","incorrect_answer":"v397b6aab3275","explanation":"Minutes — исчисляемое множественное число."},{"id":"bbd4b2f6-d846-516f-a99b-6d8f0208534c","lesson_id":"64aea20c-3109-5b2e-85e3-53594355bc3b","kind":"context_choice","prompt":"Выбери слово по смыслу контекста.","position":9,"public_payload":{"sentence":"For a small amount of uncountable water, use ___.","options":[{"id":"vc60e947ac3f1","label":"a few"},{"id":"v21f123dc4243","label":"many"},{"id":"v7591caea992b","label":"a little"}]},"answer_key":{"value":"v7591caea992b"},"reference_answer":"v7591caea992b","incorrect_answer":"vc60e947ac3f1","explanation":"С неисчисляемым количеством используется a little."},{"id":"19dc7798-81a1-52b7-a699-d8e5cbad7f48","lesson_id":"d0777de9-17e4-5429-84ca-e20fc72b2612","kind":"single_choice","prompt":"Выбери точный вариант: These shoes are too small. Do you have larger ___?","position":1,"public_payload":{"options":[{"id":"v154d2acecf30","label":"ones"},{"id":"vf3c34fbc5d8e","label":"one"},{"id":"v949a9979753d","label":"it"}]},"answer_key":{"value":"v154d2acecf30"},"reference_answer":"v154d2acecf30","incorrect_answer":"vf3c34fbc5d8e","explanation":"Shoes во множественном числе заменяется на ones."},{"id":"cc8886c6-7b10-5ba1-ae35-0378ad46ea0c","lesson_id":"d0777de9-17e4-5429-84ca-e20fc72b2612","kind":"gap","prompt":"Вставь слово из пары: ones / one.","position":2,"public_payload":{"sentence":"I prefer the blue bag, not the red ___."},"answer_key":{"accepted":["one"]},"reference_answer":"one","incorrect_answer":"ones","explanation":"Один bag заменяется словом one."},{"id":"495b42d9-19f6-55ef-9356-ac5ef37f4df6","lesson_id":"d0777de9-17e4-5429-84ca-e20fc72b2612","kind":"sentence","prompt":"Собери предложение: «Я хотел бы од