age."},{"id":"vb3b6295f5546","label":"Stay in the room until the train left without asking."},{"id":"vccdf88aa4faf","label":"Cancel the train automatically."}]},"answer_key":{"value":"v2d73d83b47a9"},"reference_answer":"v2d73d83b47a9","incorrect_answer":"vb3b6295f5546","explanation":"Разрешено хранение багажа, не продолжение проживания в номере."},{"id":"b9867e2d-be8d-539e-8d56-22648f86419b","lesson_id":"23267d8b-32a0-5aef-b4e7-de78d214dba7","kind":"dialogue","prompt":"Спроси о времени выезда.","position":8,"public_payload":{"lines":[{"speaker":"Собеседник","text":"You want to ask about the departure rule."}],"options":[{"id":"vc88655111ee7","label":"What time we needed check in yesterday?"},{"id":"v96c65edc54db","label":"What time do we need to check out?"},{"id":"va6b978fdbe69","label":"What time do we need to checking out?"}]},"answer_key":{"value":"v96c65edc54db"},"reference_answer":"v96c65edc54db","incorrect_answer":"va6b978fdbe69","explanation":"Need to check out использует начальную форму."},{"id":"d30adff3-f0ac-5a0d-a089-d519120e5c19","lesson_id":"23267d8b-32a0-5aef-b4e7-de78d214dba7","kind":"context_choice","prompt":"Выбери слово по смыслу контекста.","position":9,"public_payload":{"sentence":"Suitcases and travel bags are collectively called ___.","options":[{"id":"vb666388a58dc","label":"luggage"},{"id":"v2358648e073c","label":"luggages in this meaning"},{"id":"vf8985eef08f6","label":"receptions"}]},"answer_key":{"value":"vb666388a58dc"},"reference_answer":"vb666388a58dc","incorrect_answer":"v2358648e073c","explanation":"В обычном значении luggage — неисчисляемое обозначение багажа."},{"id":"54d6434a-e8b1-5058-8b02-be0b48b7da4a","lesson_id":"5e6a6fd3-df13-50db-b17a-edf47d37f5a0","kind":"single_choice","prompt":"Выбери точный вариант: How about ___ indoors if it rains?","position":1,"public_payload":{"options":[{"id":"v4d4108bcaa45","label":"meet to"},{"id":"v6a4a46409676","label":"meeting"},{"id":"ve7dff73356a6","label":"to meet"}]},"answer_key":{"value":