orrow laptops."},"answer_key":{"accepted":["to"]},"reference_answer":"to","incorrect_answer":"for","explanation":"После allows students требуется to borrow."},{"id":"f8fc008e-2e61-5e68-8603-762d1c0290a0","lesson_id":"87e2f114-2da5-54fa-a9f1-810f63bd7df0","kind":"sentence","prompt":"Собери предложение: «Нам разрешили пользоваться меньшей комнатой.»","position":3,"public_payload":{"tokens":[{"id":"t3","label":"us"},{"id":"t4","label":"to"},{"id":"t5","label":"use"},{"id":"t6","label":"the"},{"id":"t7","label":"smaller"},{"id":"t8","label":"room."},{"id":"t1","label":"They"},{"id":"t2","label":"allowed"}]},"answer_key":{"value":["t1","t2","t3","t4","t5","t6","t7","t8"]},"reference_answer":["t1","t2","t3","t4","t5","t6","t7","t8"],"incorrect_answer":["t2","t3","t4","t5","t6","t7","t8","t1"],"explanation":"Us обозначает получателей разрешения, to use — разрешённое действие."},{"id":"7a1a00bb-3f91-5afa-a9e0-767e875b2dd8","lesson_id":"87e2f114-2da5-54fa-a9f1-810f63bd7df0","kind":"correction","prompt":"Исправь ошибку в указанной конструкции, сохраняя остальные слова и смысл.","position":4,"public_payload":{"sentence":"The coach encouraged me try again."},"answer_key":{"accepted":["The coach encouraged me to try again."]},"reference_answer":"The coach encouraged me to try again.","incorrect_answer":"The coach encouraged me try again.","explanation":"После encouraged me нужен инфинитив с to."},{"id":"d4d6106c-b33f-5c93-9bd2-ec3a7b9f49d4","lesson_id":"87e2f114-2da5-54fa-a9f1-810f63bd7df0","kind":"reading","prompt":"Зачем начинающим разрешили одолжить оборудование?","position":5,"public_payload":{"passage":"The club allowed beginners to borrow equipment for their first session. The tutor encouraged everyone to try a simple task before buying anything. One student found the activity harder than expected and decided to attend another introductory session. The tutor supported that choice rather than promising immediate success. Permission to borrow equipment reduced the cost of trying, but it did not remove the need to practise.","options":[{"id":"v7070ac7789a8","label":"So practice would become unnecessary."},{"id":"v653959c1193e","label":"So every student would have to buy immediately."},{"id":"v2afeb9d1bb24","label":"So they could try the activity before buying equipment."}]},"answer_key":{"value":"v2afeb9d1bb24"},"reference_answer":"v2afeb9d1bb24","incorrect_answer":"v7070ac7789a8","explanation":"Разрешение снижает стоимость первой попытки, не гарантируя результат."},{"id":"da6facd4-38c3-5775-82b4-188ff99231d3","lesson_id":"87e2f114-2da5-54fa-a9f1-810f63bd7df0","kind":"matching","prompt":"Соедини слова с переводом в контексте урока.","position":6,"public_payload":{"left":[{"id":"l01dba9111145","label":"allow"},{"id":"lfbb677fca579","label":"encourage"},{"id":"l7ed309bb4317","label":"attempt"},{"id":"l15055a2641d4","label":"permission"}],"right":[{"id":"rc2551bf6eb88","label":"попытка"},{"id":"r397334461b65","label":"разрешение"},{"id":"ra7c7be55a907","label":"разрешать"},{"id":"r72829f14637b","label":"поощрять, поддерживать"}]},"answer_key":{"pairs":{"l01dba9111145":"ra7c7be55a907","lfbb677fca579":"r72829f14637b","l7ed309bb4317":"rc2551bf6eb88","l15055a2641d4":"r397334461b65"}},"reference_answer":{"l01dba9111145":"ra7c7be55a907","lfbb677fca579":"r72829f14637b","l7ed309bb4317":"rc2551bf6eb88","l15055a2641d4":"r397334461b65"},"incorrect_answer":{"l01dba9111145":"r72829f14637b","lfbb677fca579":"ra7c7be55a907","l7ed309bb4317":"rc2551bf6eb88","l15055a2641d4":"r397334461b65"},"explanation":"В этих контекстах: allow — разрешать; encourage — поощрять, поддерживать; attempt — попытка; permission — разрешение."},{"id":"ab6d7d52-0eb1-5b84-b856-99ddaf479022","lesson_id":"87e2f114-2da5-54fa-a9f1-810f63bd7df0","kind":"reading","prompt":"Как преподаватель отнёсся к повторному вводному занятию?","position":7,"public_payload":{"passage":"The club allowed beginners to borrow equipment for their first session. The tutor encouraged everyone to try a simple 