,{"id":"t5","label":"the"},{"id":"t6","label":"library."},{"id":"t1","label":"She"},{"id":"t2","label":"has"}]},"answer_key":{"value":["t1","t2","t3","t4","t5","t6"]},"reference_answer":["t1","t2","t3","t4","t5","t6"],"incorrect_answer":["t2","t3","t4","t5","t6","t1"],"explanation":"В данном контексте has gone связывает уход с нынешним отсутствием."},{"id":"e9e38167-1bdd-5465-a1b7-3c494cb87044","lesson_id":"1f8976f2-62b3-58e9-90bd-d25ce36c9c90","kind":"correction","prompt":"Исправь ошибку в указанной конструкции, сохраняя остальные слова и смысл.","position":4,"public_payload":{"sentence":"He has went to the office."},"answer_key":{"accepted":["He has gone to the office."]},"reference_answer":"He has gone to the office.","incorrect_answer":"He has went to the office.","explanation":"После has требуется причастие gone, не went."},{"id":"d6b5a442-25a7-522e-8bc7-3309510b3461","lesson_id":"1f8976f2-62b3-58e9-90bd-d25ce36c9c90","kind":"reading","prompt":"Почему Мары не было в клубе?","position":5,"public_payload":{"passage":"When Alex arrived at the club, Mara was away. A volunteer said she had gone to collect a parcel and would return later. Alex had been to the new post office the day before, so he knew the walk was short. He waited in the café. Mara returned twenty minutes later with the parcel, and they began setting up the display.","options":[{"id":"v4b1332de6af8","label":"She had never visited a post office."},{"id":"ve8a206b8c0ea","label":"She had gone to collect a parcel."},{"id":"v348e6031df07","label":"She had already returned before Alex arrived."}]},"answer_key":{"value":"ve8a206b8c0ea"},"reference_answer":"ve8a206b8c0ea","incorrect_answer":"v348e6031df07","explanation":"Gone описывает незавершённое к тому моменту отсутствие."},{"id":"9325c0be-602a-5eb4-83d6-a4d9630d748f","lesson_id":"1f8976f2-62b3-58e9-90bd-d25ce36c9c90","kind":"matching","prompt":"Соедини слова с переводом в контексте урока.","position":6,"public_payload":{"left":[{"id":"l4aac999e74ea","la