ешнем отсутствии после ухода.","position":8,"public_payload":{"lines":[{"speaker":"Собеседник","text":"Is Kim in the building?"}],"options":[{"id":"v84c3050f05c5","label":"No, she have gone to the station."},{"id":"v5a608095292b","label":"No, she has gone to the station."},{"id":"v365318d55845","label":"No, she has went to the station."}]},"answer_key":{"value":"v5a608095292b"},"reference_answer":"v5a608095292b","incorrect_answer":"v365318d55845","explanation":"Has gone to согласовано с she."},{"id":"f22a7a0a-4fa6-507b-856a-50fda78da7fd","lesson_id":"1f8976f2-62b3-58e9-90bd-d25ce36c9c90","kind":"context_choice","prompt":"Выбери слово по смыслу контекста.","position":9,"public_payload":{"sentence":"Someone who is not present at their usual place is ___.","options":[{"id":"ve205b9e426a1","label":"away"},{"id":"ve6b9dd27e145","label":"already returned necessarily"},{"id":"vd99a249cef86","label":"indoors necessarily"}]},"answer_key":{"value":"ve205b9e426a1"},"reference_answer":"ve205b9e426a1","incorrect_answer":"ve6b9dd27e145","explanation":"Away обозначает отсутствие на месте."},{"id":"20b2fc93-afca-5a0f-a463-5aa6f9af9a1b","lesson_id":"2b46fadf-d8b0-58ad-aeb7-378103dfa86b","kind":"single_choice","prompt":"Выбери точный вариант: The café closed last year. It does not serve customers ___.","position":1,"public_payload":{"options":[{"id":"vb4c6ab2b95f5","label":"already since"},{"id":"veebc44d1ee9d","label":"anymore"},{"id":"v07e6073d689f","label":"still at all"}]},"answer_key":{"value":"veebc44d1ee9d"},"reference_answer":"veebc44d1ee9d","incorrect_answer":"v07e6073d689f","explanation":"Not ... anymore описывает прекращение прежней деятельности."},{"id":"3e6cd14e-e482-5dca-b5c4-def59575318b","lesson_id":"2b46fadf-d8b0-58ad-aeb7-378103dfa86b","kind":"gap","prompt":"Вставь слово из пары: still / anymore.","position":2,"public_payload":{"sentence":"He ___ lives in the same house; he has not moved."},"answer_key":{"accepted":["still"]},"reference_answer":"still","incorrect_an