е: «К нашему приходу обсуждение уже закончилось.»","position":3,"public_payload":{"tokens":[{"id":"t3","label":"time"},{"id":"t4","label":"we"},{"id":"t5","label":"arrived,"},{"id":"t6","label":"the"},{"id":"t7","label":"discussion"},{"id":"t8","label":"had"},{"id":"t9","label":"ended."},{"id":"t1","label":"By"},{"id":"t2","label":"the"}]},"answer_key":{"value":["t1","t2","t3","t4","t5","t6","t7","t8","t9"]},"reference_answer":["t1","t2","t3","t4","t5","t6","t7","t8","t9"],"incorrect_answer":["t2","t3","t4","t5","t6","t7","t8","t9","t1"],"explanation":"Эта модель устанавливает, что прибытие было позже завершения."},{"id":"4433d9bc-7be5-5371-bbd4-dd598c91ddd0","lesson_id":"138cc560-55b5-50bf-927a-217f1859b4cd","kind":"correction","prompt":"Исправь ошибку в указанной конструкции, сохраняя остальные слова и смысл.","position":4,"public_payload":{"sentence":"By the time I arrived, they has already left."},"answer_key":{"accepted":["By the time I arrived, they had already left."]},"reference_answer":"By the time I arrived, they had already left.","incorrect_answer":"By the time I arrived, they has already left.","explanation":"Для предшествующего события в прошлом используется had left."},{"id":"e97bded2-a255-5624-b3ec-5e5fed0c0071","lesson_id":"138cc560-55b5-50bf-927a-217f1859b4cd","kind":"reading","prompt":"Что наблюдатели не видели?","position":5,"public_payload":{"passage":"The summary said that the observers arrived when the vote ended. The meeting record was more precise: by the time they arrived, the vote had already finished and the chair was reading the result. This difference mattered because the observers had not witnessed the voting itself. They could report what happened afterwards, but their presence at the announcement did not make them witnesses to the earlier procedure. The editor revised the summary to preserve that sequence rather than implying an overlap that the record did not establish.","options":[{"id":"v3ca81f5ad5fd","label":"The announcement of the result."},{"id":"v1f4bad5e2f1a","label":"Any part of the meeting afterwards."},{"id":"v39a1ac83e784","label":"The voting itself."}]},"answer_key":{"value":"v39a1ac83e784"},"reference_answer":"v39a1ac83e784","incorrect_answer":"v3ca81f5ad5fd","explanation":"Они прибыли после завершения голосования."},{"id":"6ec44fe1-0259-5b9f-9adf-d98132123d9a","lesson_id":"138cc560-55b5-50bf-927a-217f1859b4cd","kind":"matching","prompt":"Соедини слова с переводом в контексте урока.","position":6,"public_payload":{"left":[{"id":"l7649feb518bf","label":"prior"},{"id":"l83ebb9117eb0","label":"subsequent"},{"id":"l7c81c725da1e","label":"overlap"},{"id":"l0d11220c61aa","label":"sequence"}],"right":[{"id":"r3839bf82b5e5","label":"совпадение во времени"},{"id":"rd8e42cef8145","label":"последовательность"},{"id":"r41fed84c6f2a","label":"предшествующий"},{"id":"rc8e07cbad970","label":"последующий"}]},"answer_key":{"pairs":{"l7649feb518bf":"r41fed84c6f2a","l83ebb9117eb0":"rc8e07cbad970","l7c81c725da1e":"r3839bf82b5e5","l0d11220c61aa":"rd8e42cef8145"}},"reference_answer":{"l7649feb518bf":"r41fed84c6f2a","l83ebb9117eb0":"rc8e07cbad970","l7c81c725da1e":"r3839bf82b5e5","l0d11220c61aa":"rd8e42cef8145"},"incorrect_answer":{"l7649feb518bf":"rc8e07cbad970","l83ebb9117eb0":"r41fed84c6f2a","l7c81c725da1e":"r3839bf82b5e5","l0d11220c61aa":"rd8e42cef8145"},"explanation":"В этих контекстах: prior — предшествующий; subsequent — последующий; overlap — совпадение во времени; sequence — последовательность."},{"id":"020b2a46-72c8-5639-adf8-20596265795e","lesson_id":"138cc560-55b5-50bf-927a-217f1859b4cd","kind":"reading","prompt":"Почему потребовалось уточнить by the time?","position":7,"public_payload":{"passage":"The summary said that the observers arrived when the vote ended. The meeting record was more precise: by the time they arrived, the vote had already finished and the chair was reading the result. This difference mattered because the observers had not witnessed the voting itself. They could report what happened afterwards, but their presence at the announcement did not make them witnesses to the earlier procedure. The editor revised the summary to preserve that sequence rather than implying an overlap that the record did not establish.","options":[{"id":"vc0b467a04b11","label":"To make the result automatically invalid."},{"id":"v50dfd2faadaa","label":"To avoid implying that arrival and the vote’s ending overlapped."},{"id":"v2a72ed7490d0","label":"To claim they had arrived before the meeting began."}]},"answer_key":{"value":"v50dfd2faadaa"},"reference_answer":"v50dfd2faadaa","incorrect_answer":"v2a72ed7490d0","explanation":"Уточнение сохраняет хронологию, не устанавливая новых оценок результата."},{"id":"f2334dc4-1f52-58ca-9fe7-e14a753d029c","lesson_id":"138cc560-55b5-50bf-927a-217f1859b4cd","kind":"dialogue","prompt":"Сообщи, что демонстрация завершилась до твоего прихода.","position":8,"public_payload":{"lines":[{"speaker":"Собеседник","text":"Did you see the demonstration?"}],"options":[{"id":"v1231870da8ae","label":"No. By the time I arrived, it has ended yesterday."},{"id":"v3fe53305fbd7","label":"No. By the time I had arriving, it end."},{"id":"v46b7d8eacfeb","label":"No. By the time I arrived, it had ended."}]},"answer_key":{"value":"v46b7d8eacfeb"},"reference_answer":"v46b7d8eacfeb","incorrect_answer":"v1231870da8ae","explanation":"Past Perfect задаёт предшествующее завершение."},{"id":"270199c3-3f52-5f17-859c-8f58ffdee6b2","lesson_id":"138cc560-55b5-50bf-927a-217f1859b4cd","kind":"context_choice","prompt":"Выбери слово по смыслу контекста.","position":9,"public_payload":{"sentence":"An event occurring after another is ___.","options":[{"id":"ve6f7cd6249a4","label":"simultaneous necessarily"},{"id":"v8962078deb21","label":"subsequent"},{"id":"vf211c7e5ab79","label":"prior"}]},"answer_key":{"value":"v8962078deb21"},"reference_answer":"v8962078deb21","incorrect_answer":"vf211c7e5ab79","explanation":"Subsequent означает последующий."},{"id":"2190e83d-29d