 confusing after reading the unclear notice."},"answer_key":{"accepted":["I felt confused after reading the unclear notice."]},"reference_answer":"I felt confused after reading the unclear notice.","incorrect_answer":"I felt confusing after reading the unclear notice.","explanation":"Для пережитой реакции после felt нужно confused."},{"id":"81be30a5-0e2e-5645-94bb-c4699af8e40e","lesson_id":"37bdc25d-a8fd-5bea-81c6-338d4b130ccd","kind":"reading","prompt":"Может ли человек быть interested и confused одновременно?","position":5,"public_payload":{"passage":"The draft instructions used several unfamiliar abbreviations. The writer described the topic as interesting, but a trial group found the explanation confusing. Some readers were interested in the subject yet confused about the order of the steps. The editor kept the useful content and added examples rather than assuming that a strong topic would make every explanation clear. The revision separated two judgements: whether the subject attracted attention and whether the instructions helped readers perform the task.","options":[{"id":"v499dbdc34851","label":"No; confused describes only the printed page here."},{"id":"v3d6ceece7cab","label":"Yes; interest in the topic does not guarantee understanding of the steps."},{"id":"vac3c0c4753fe","label":"No; interest always establishes complete understanding."}]},"answer_key":{"value":"v3d6ceece7cab"},"reference_answer":"v3d6ceece7cab","incorrect_answer":"vac3c0c4753fe","explanation":"Текст прямо описывает такое сочетание у части читателей."},{"id":"effe02b6-9519-527f-91a9-087fd7b92aed","lesson_id":"37bdc25d-a8fd-5bea-81c6-338d4b130ccd","kind":"matching","prompt":"Соедини слова с переводом в контексте урока.","position":6,"public_payload":{"left":[{"id":"la2bad8256063","label":"confusing"},{"id":"l5927715ec2a9","label":"confused"},{"id":"l7ce77fbd7cc7","label":"engaging"},{"id":"l03a9c8468b2d","label":"engaged"}],"right":[{"id":"r5e1260b6a3b1","label":"увлекательный"},{"id":"r6d