es reflect the times that suit them, not a claim that one class is better for every student.","options":[{"id":"v8f54f96b2d22","label":"The evening materials are incorrect."},{"id":"v903a7b03a138","label":"Every student dislikes evenings."},{"id":"v50f79afae2c7","label":"She can study before work."}]},"answer_key":{"value":"v50f79afae2c7"},"reference_answer":"v50f79afae2c7","incorrect_answer":"v8f54f96b2d22","explanation":"Причина — личное расписание."},{"id":"8fb40d14-9018-522b-97e0-951f53c46354","lesson_id":"3fd561a1-bb1d-5012-bac7-dced3b292f88","kind":"matching","prompt":"Соедини слова с переводом в контексте урока.","position":6,"public_payload":{"left":[{"id":"l56e470d60947","label":"prefer"},{"id":"lbd85044a547e","label":"option"},{"id":"l596f48f53f1c","label":"personal"},{"id":"l7cb224632e95","label":"choice"}],"right":[{"id":"r180c4904fd49","label":"личный"},{"id":"r9d0266bb0131","label":"выбор"},{"id":"rb23da3ee1cfc","label":"предпочитать"},{"id":"re08b933abcdf","label":"вариант"}]},"answer_key":{"pairs":{"l56e470d60947":"rb23da3ee1cfc","lbd85044a547e":"re08b933abcdf","l596f48f53f1c":"r180c4904fd49","l7cb224632e95":"r9d0266bb0131"}},"reference_answer":{"l56e470d60947":"rb23da3ee1cfc","lbd85044a547e":"re08b933abcdf","l596f48f53f1c":"r180c4904fd49","l7cb224632e95":"r9d0266bb0131"},"incorrect_answer":{"l56e470d60947":"re08b933abcdf","lbd85044a547e":"rb23da3ee1cfc","l596f48f53f1c":"r180c4904fd49","l7cb224632e95":"r9d0266bb0131"},"explanation":"В этих контекстах: prefer — предпочитать; option — вариант; personal — личный; choice — выбор."},{"id":"7445407f-1ed5-5e57-8848-62c12019c542","lesson_id":"3fd561a1-bb1d-5012-bac7-dced3b292f88","kind":"reading","prompt":"Одинаковы ли учебные материалы?","position":7,"public_payload":{"passage":"Lea prefers the morning class to the evening one because she can study before work. Her colleague prefers evenings because of a different schedule. Both classes use the same materials. Their choices reflect the times that suit them, not a claim that one class is better for every student.","options":[{"id":"v108730a43ee8","label":"Yes, both classes use the same materials."},{"id":"v07db757326c0","label":"No, the morning class has no books."},{"id":"v768bd1815118","label":"The text says every book is different."}]},"answer_key":{"value":"v108730a43ee8"},"reference_answer":"v108730a43ee8","incorrect_answer":"v07db757326c0","explanation":"Сравнение касается времени, не разных материалов."},{"id":"c68f694d-daa7-58bc-a4fb-6b0ce0ed62ef","lesson_id":"3fd561a1-bb1d-5012-bac7-dced3b292f88","kind":"dialogue","prompt":"Вырази предпочтение моделью prefer A to B.","position":8,"public_payload":{"lines":[{"speaker":"Собеседник","text":"Which drink would you choose?"}],"options":[{"id":"va572dcf66a1d","label":"I prefer water than juice."},{"id":"v5921b0f9319c","label":"I prefers water to juice."},{"id":"v9a6d6e972229","label":"I prefer water to juice."}]},"answer_key":{"value":"v9a6d6e972229"},"reference_answer":"v9a6d6e972229","incorrect_answer":"va572dcf66a1d","explanation":"С I нужен prefer, второй вариант вводится to."},{"id":"dc26d6d5-3d05-527f-8f55-832b9b867b30","lesson_id":"3fd561a1-bb1d-5012-bac7-dced3b292f88","kind":"context_choice","prompt":"Выбери слово по смыслу контекста.","position":9,"public_payload":{"sentence":"A choice based on one person’s circumstances is ___.","options":[{"id":"vac9102bcce9e","label":"compulsory for everyone"},{"id":"v74e6f78043cb","label":"personal"},{"id":"v47575661019f","label":"universal necessarily"}]},"answer_key":{"value":"v74e6f78043cb"},"reference_answer":"v74e6f78043cb","incorrect_answer":"v47575661019f","explanation":"Personal — личный, не универсально обязательный."},{"id":"d66f94ce-09dd-5d4c-8806-09069d414e95","lesson_id":"a4c7c25f-c3cd-5e7a-9baf-cf7953690718","kind":"single_choice","prompt":"Выбери точный вариант: This is the most useful guide I have ever ___.","position":1,"public_payload":{"options":[{"id":"vb6d5983145fd","label":"read"},{"id":"vba00c9bc4471","label":"reading"},{"id":"vb3abadb0efcc","label":"reads"}]},"answer_key":{"value":"vb6d5983145fd"},"reference_answer":"vb6d5983145fd","incorrect_answer":"vba00c9bc4471","explanation":"После have требуется причастие read."},{"id":"cd17fa57-fa14-5047-b2fd-4b2bf098c366","lesson_id":"a4c7c25f-c3cd-5e7a-9baf-cf7953690718","kind":"gap","prompt":"Вставь слово из пары: have / am.","position":2,"public_payload":{"sentence":"It is the best workshop I ___ ever attended."},"answer_key":{"accepted":["have"]},"reference_answer":"have","incorrect_answer":"am","explanation":"Опыт до настоящего выражается have attended."},{"id":"ca4b611c-c544-53d9-a5a4-eb04032d827f","lesson_id":"a4c7c25f-c3cd-5e7a-9baf-cf7953690718","kind":"sentence","prompt":"Собери предложение: «Это лучший курс из всех, которые я когда-либо проходил.»","position":3,"public_payload":{"tokens":[{"id":"t3","label":"the"},{"id":"t4","label":"best"},{"id":"t5","label":"course"},{"id":"t6","label":"I"},{"id":"t7","label":"have"},{"id":"t8","label":"ever"},{"id":"t9","label":"taken."},{"id":"t1","label":"It"},{"id":"t2","label":"is"}]},"answer_key":{"value":["t1","t2","t3","t4","t5","t6","t7","t8","t9"]},"reference_answer":["t1","t2","t3","t4","t5","t6","t7","t8","t9"],"incorrect_answer":["t2","t3","t4","t5","t6","t7","t8","t9","t1"],"explanation":"Область сравнения ограничена опытом говорящего."},{"id":"11aa11cc-f753-5079-a963-dfa0cd7c0d9f","lesson_id":"a4c7c25f-c3cd-5e7a-9baf-cf7953690718","kind":"correction","prompt":"Исправь ошибку в указанной конструкции, сохраняя остальные слова и смысл.","position":4,"public_payload":{"sentence":"This is the best talk I have ever hear."},"answer_key":{"accepted":["This is the best talk I have ever heard."]},"reference_answer":"This is the best talk I have ever heard.","incorrect_answer":"This is the best talk I have ever hear.","explanation":"После have требуется heard."},{"id":"99acc786-1786-553d-9827-9ec02c5bc717","lesson_id":"a4c7c25f-c3cd-5e7a-9baf-cf7953690718","kind":"reading","prompt":"Что ограничивает оценку Аны?","position":5,"public_payload":{"passage":"After the workshop, Ana called it the best course she had ever taken. She had attended only three similar courses, all at local clubs. Her friend enjoyed the workshop too, but preferred another teacher’s approach. Ana clarified that she was describing her own experience, not ranking every course available or deciding what would suit every learner.","options":[{"id":"v7a33488a22d4","label":"A study of every course in the country."},{"id":"vef1552b22f24","label":"A guarantee that everyone shares her preference."},{"id":"vc54c25ee3dff","label":"Her own experience of a few courses."}]},"answer_key":{"value":"vc54c25ee3dff"},"reference_answer":"vc54c25ee3dff","incorrect_answer":"v7a33488a22d4","explanation":"Сравнение лично и основано на ограниченном опыте."},{"id":"af3140f8-11a4-51ec-ab74-4d9c1c290c82","lesson_id":"a4c7c25f-c3cd-5e7a-9baf-cf7953690718","kind":"matching","prompt":"Соедини слова с переводом в контексте урока.","position":6,"public_payload":{"left":[{"id":"lf5769634e7e3","label":"experience"},{"id":"l14f55b0de146","label":"comparison"},{"id":"l0501c167bc1a","label":"memorable"},{"id":"l5b178cdd491d","label":"personal"}],"right":[{"id":"rec2845edf5b1","label":"запоминающийся"},{"id":"r12ad92f9bb05","label":"личный"},{"id":"r091bcc3e0e8b","label":"опыт"},{"id":"r2017bcc5a582","label":"сравнение"}]},"answer_key":{"pairs":{"lf5769634e7e3":"r091bcc3e0e8b","l14f55b0de146":"r2017bcc5a582","l0501c167bc1a":"rec2845edf5b1","l5b178cdd491d":"r12ad92f9bb05"}},"reference_answer":{"lf5769634e7e3":"r091bcc3e0e8b","l14f55b0de146":"r2017bcc5a582","l0501c167bc1a":"rec2845edf5b1","l5b178cdd491d":"r12ad92f9bb05"},"incorrect_answer":{"lf5769634e7e3":"r2017bcc5a582","l14f55b0de146":"r091bcc3e0e8b","l0501c167bc1a":"rec2845edf5b1","l5b178cdd491d":"r12ad92f9bb05"},"explanation":"В этих контекстах: experience — опыт; comparison — сравнение; memorable — запоминающийся; personal — личный."},{"id":"28cd0dbb-fbc4-5767-a3b9-3efad7639821","lesson_id":"a4c7c25f-c3cd-5e7a-9baf-cf7953690718","kind":"reading","prompt":"Была ли реакция друга полностью такой же?","position":7,"public_payload":{"passage":"After the workshop, Ana called it the best course she had ever taken. She had attended only three similar courses, all at local clubs. Her friend enjoyed the workshop too, but preferred another teacher’s approach. Ana clarified that she was describing her own experience, not ranking every course available or deciding what would suit every learner.","options":[{"id":"v2a2878a45782","label":"No; the friend preferred another teacher’s approach."},{"id":"v6e5a81ed4719","label":"Yes; every preference was identical."},{"id":"v141ff8e53b94","label":"The friend had not attended the workshop."}]},"answer_key":{"value":"v2a2878a45782"},"reference_answer":"v2a2878a45782","incorrect_answer":"v6e5a81ed4719","explanation":"Друг тоже получил удовольствие, но имел другое предпочтение."},{"id":"43a87bcf-9107-5147-bc5f-49d26916a96c","lesson_id":"a4c7c25f-c3cd-5e7a-9baf-cf7953690718","kind":"dialogue","prompt":"Сохрани область личного сравнения.","position":8,"public_payload":{"lines":[{"speaker":"Собеседник","text":"Can “the best book I have read” mean best for every reader?"}],"options":[{"id":"v58d2e81a6cbf","label":"Yes; ever automatically includes everyone."},{"id":"v4268b293d10d","label":"Yes; personal experience proves a global ranking."},{"id":"v7033f1a879c5","label":"Not by itself; it describes the speaker’s reading experience."}]},"answer_key":{"value":"v7033f1a879c5"},"reference_answer":"v7033f1a879c5","incorrect_answer":"v58d2e81a6cbf","explanation":"Указание I have read не заменяет сравнение всех читателей."},{"id":"e1508c08-4682-5884-ae9b-89a87960c35d","lesson_id":"a4c7c25f-c3cd-5e7a-9baf-cf7953690718","kind":"context_choice","prompt":"Выбери слово по смыслу контекста.","position":9,"public_payload":{"sentence":"An event easy to remember can be ___.","options":[{"id":"v89bc51c0bebc","label":"universal necessarily"},{"id":"vf0e43f5ffa73","label":"memorable"},{"id":"v2eaadd0d736d","label":"unnoticed necessarily"}]},"answer_key":{"value":"vf0e43f5ffa73"},"reference_answer":"vf0e43f5ffa73","incorrect_answer":"v2eaadd0d736d","explanation":"Memorable — запоминающийся."},{"id":"1e6eed29-ee04-5c3f-b09d-9f4c6c898730","lesson_id":"60ae4709-039c-5ef1-b479-cc9fece939ff","kind":"single_choice","prompt":"Выбери точный вариант: The rule prohibited visitors from entering. They were not allowed ___ inside.","position":1,"public_payload":{"options":[{"id":"v1ac22dbd93fa","label":"to go"},{"id":"v031b3b4adc2b","label":"going to"},{"id":"vb6d51e8bff36","label":"went to"}]},"answer_key":{"value":"v1ac22dbd93fa"},"reference_answer":"v1ac22dbd93fa","incorrect_answer":"v031b3b4adc2b","explanation":"Allowed to go передаёт разрешение или его отсутствие."},{"id":"3d7919b7-9d3c-5ee2-85da-1e0664571b14","lesson_id":"60ae4709-039c-5ef1-b479-cc9fece939ff","kind":"gap","prompt":"Вставь слово из пары: allowing / allowed.","position":2,"public_payload":{"sentence":"She was not ___ to use the equipment without training."},"answer_key":{"accepted":["allowed"]},"reference_answer":"allowed","incorrect_answer":"allowing","explanation":"В пассивной модели разрешения используется allowed."},{"id":"7504ebc4-593e-579b-8b44-12b38c59fa8f","lesson_id":"60ae4709-039c-5ef1-b479-cc9fece939ff","kind":"sentence","prompt":"Собери предложение: «Нам не разрешили входить в комнату.»","position":3,"public_payload":{"tokens":[{"id":"t3","label":"not"},{"id":"t4","label":"allowed"},{"id":"t5","label":"to"},{"id":"t6","label":"enter"},{"id":"t7","label":"the"},{"id":"t8","label":"room."},{"id":"t1","label":"We"},{"id":"t2","label":"were"}]},"answer_key":{"value":["t1","t2","t3","t4","t5","t6","t7","t8"]},"reference_answer":["t1","t2","t3","t4","t5","t6","t7","t8"],"incorrect_answer":["t2","t3","t4","t5","t6","t7","t8","t1"],"explanation":"Речь о разрешении, не обязательно о физической возможности."},{"id":"e7c373aa-0da4-52d4-9e36-eee144fe31d7","lesson_id":"60ae4709-039c-5ef1-b479-cc9fece939ff","kind":"correction","prompt":"Исправь ошибку в указанной конструкции, сохраняя остальные слова и смысл.","position":4,"public_payload":{"sentence":"He was not allowed use the computer."},"answer_key":{"accepted":["He was not allowed to use the computer."]},"reference_answer":"He was not allowed to use the computer.","incorrect_answer":"He was not allowed use the computer.","explanation":"После allowed требуется to use."},{"id":"7e10a979-e12a-5911-a523-77e6d7f27afd","lesson_id":"60ae4709-039c-5ef1-b479-cc9fece939ff","kind":"reading","prompt":"Почему в архив нельзя было взять камеру?","position":5,"public_payload":{"passage":"The visitor knew how to use the camera, but she was not allowed to take it into the archive room. The restriction protected fragile materials and did not question her photography skills. At another building, a broken lift meant she could not reach the upper floor with her heavy equipment. These were different barriers: one concerned permission, the other practical access.","options":[{"id":"v5063207e02f5","label":"The visitor did not know how to use a camera."},{"id":"v0b8507c2ce85","label":"Every camera was broken."},{"id":"v15ffdaa7c1c4","label":"A rule restricted its use there."}]},"answer_key":{"value":"v15ffdaa7c1c4"},"reference_answer":"v15ffdaa7c1c4","incorrect_answer":"v5063207e02f5","explanation":"Запрет отличён от умения пользоваться камерой."},{"id":"116730fb-59cd-5b20-bc3b-4acb5c079fb1","lesson_id":"60ae4709-039c-5ef1-b479-cc9fece939ff","kind":"matching","prompt":"Соедини слова с переводом в контексте урока.","position":6,"public_payload":{"left":[{"id":"lbf529bc3065f","label":"ability"},{"id":"l59084146fade","label":"permission"},{"id":"l491ecb77f860","label":"restriction"},{"id":"l164deb0adf37","label":"access"}],"right":[{"id":"rd1de6600688a","label":"ограничение"},{"id":"r626188e6f71b","label":"доступ"},{"id":"r9e4ba3e3679b","la